        {
          "title": null,
          "text": "Once upon a time,I witnessed a stranger isolated in a difficult situation,and that moment deeply touched my heart. \nThus,\"LOVNBHELP\" came into being,the name combines the meaning of \"Love\" and \"Help\",representing the use of love to meet the needs of others,to provide sincere help. \n\"LOVNBHELP\" accompanies everyone in need with love.In the future,\"LOVNBHELP\" will continue to convey love and warmth,and become a strong backing in more people's lives.",
