        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Much Like the One I Saw In A Fashion Demo",
        "reviewDescription": "I bought this because I saw a scarf being used like this as an accent on a pencil skirt.  It is much like the one shown in the demo....I'm looking forward to trying it.  It is very nice for the money.",
