      {
        "username": "Bullet",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AE27ZIIHOS6Z7GXRU6QNQ5RK5XPQ",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AE27ZIIHOS6Z7GXRU6QNQ5RK5XPQ",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "A Piece of art!",
        "reviewDescription": "I ordered the LOVNBHELP Russian Style Muffler Scarf as a gift for my wife to use around the house when sitting and reading during the summer in our air conditioned home.  She regularly complains when the air kicks in and she is exposed to a blast of cold air when dressed in summer clothing.  She is now wearing a winter cotton shawl to keep her warm.  These scarves are lighter weight and will fit the bill well. Unfortunately, she immediately fell in love with the beautiful fabric and told me she would not wear them around the house and will save it for a special occasion.  (Can't win!)The directions in the online descriptive literature that this garment is to be hand washed and dried. This is understandable in that it has a ring of long red tassels around the border.  The stitching and quality of the cotton/polymer fabric is excellent and this shawl should last a long time.I recommend this purchase.",
        "date": "2025-08-07",
        "position": 3,
        "reviewedIn": "Reviewed in the United States on August 7, 2025",
        "reviewId": "R638T9NGIUAJ8",
        "reviewUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/customer-reviews/R638T9NGIUAJ8/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?ie=UTF8",
        "reviewImages": [],
        "reviewReaction": null,
        "isVerified": false,
        "isAmazonVine": false,
        "avatar": null,
        "variant": "Color: 02 Red",
