            "value": "02 Red"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "username": "ES",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AHBHKEDBNRSULYTMAQXC2Q3IZPIA",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHBHKEDBNRSULYTMAQXC2Q3IZPIA",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Beautiful colors!!!",
        "reviewDescription": "I have to say that I was very impressed when I received  this Russian style shawl/scarf.  The shawl is beautiful, great quality, very soft, and light, and the colors are amazing. I'm 5’2” and 108lb and the shall covers my front and back perfectly. It can be worn during the day with jeans and boots, or at night with a dress. And the best thing is the price!!",
        "date": "2025-08-12",
