        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Versatile and warm",
        "reviewDescription": "I love my new shawl! The fabric almost feels like a thin wool, and it's actually very warm against chills. The design and colors are vibrant, and you can wear these in so many ways. The tassels are nice and long, too, and they are decently full, so you get an expensive look. As a plus-size woman, this fits easily over my shoulders and top. Very happy with this.",
