      {
        "username": "Amber",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AFR3XKOMZUFRZ7IQSFOVHBG7D7ZA",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFR3XKOMZUFRZ7IQSFOVHBG7D7ZA",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "True to size, thick - kiddo's smile and \"thanks, Mom!\" made it worth the high price tag.",
        "reviewDescription": "It didn't shrink, it's pretty soft, and it's nice and thick.  No zipper but he wanted this design so badly he was willing to change his style up a bit.  I bought a 2xl in case I wanted to throw it in the dryer, but because of the design I am not going to do that - it's a shame, it is true to size. I should have purchased the XL.  Great item, bold colors. I'm old so I don't know anything else about it except his friends like it, too.",
        "date": "2020-07-29",
        "position": 1,
        "reviewedIn": "Reviewed in the United States on July 29, 2020",
        "reviewId": "RUZV7KZ5DAZ7L",
        "reviewUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/customer-reviews/RUZV7KZ5DAZ7L/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?ie=UTF8",
