      {
        "username": "Alisa",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AHJRPEI2X2YRP5TXIWY24E6KSCDQ",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHJRPEI2X2YRP5TXIWY24E6KSCDQ",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Beautiful Traditional Dress",
        "reviewDescription": "The media could not be loaded.\n                \n            \n                \n            \n            \n        \n    \n    \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    This Russian traditional dress is absolutely stunning and looks just like the pictures. The colors are vibrant, and the gold detailing is beautifully done, adding an authentic and festive look. My daughter felt like a princess wearing it and received so many compliments! The included headpiece is well-crafted with little gems and pearls that sparkle in the light. The dress fits nicely and has a good amount of volume in the skirt for twirling. The only downside is that the fabric was a little prickly, according to my daughter, especially around the sleeves and waist. However, wearing a thin shirt underneath solved that issue easily. Overall, it’s a well-made costume perfect for cultural events, performances, or dress-up play",
        "date": "2025-04-30",
        "position": 2,
