      "rawText": "Product description\nSmilerSmile Extra Large Floral Pashmina Shawl \nWhere Fashion Meets Tradition \nInspired by traditional Russian patterns, this shawl blends classic heritage with modern elegance. Its delicate design and long tassels bring grace and vitality. \nOur costumes can be used for shawls, scarves and neckers. Windshield, dust and warmth are all available. The material is soft and the texture is meticulous. You can mix and match freely without any worries. Inspire your artistic cells! \nAll Seasons Applicable \nSpring,summer,Autumn and winter wear,regardless of season. \nProduct Details \nClear Prints & Beautiful Patterns \nScarf shawl exquisite print, detailed texture, vintage art pattern, are popular women like. \nSoft Cotton Blending Fiber \nBy the process of acrylic fiber, acrylic fiber has the smooth, soft and elastic feel . This product is more colorful than natural cashmere. \n25 CM Long & Elegant Tassels \nExtended tassels sway gracefully with every step you take. \n\t\nRussian Style Muffler Warm Scarf with Tassel Women's Traditional Scarf Wrap S... \nSmilerSmile Thick Pashmina Shawls and Wraps for Evening Dress, Extra Large Wo... \nSmilerSmile Cashmere Feel Shawl Wrap with Tassel \nSmilerSmile Colorful Scarf Wraps for Womens Tassel Shawl Wrap \nSmilerSmile Colorful Scarf Wraps for Womens Tassel Shawl Wrap \nSmilerSmile 27.5\" Silk Like Head Scarf For Women, Satin Hair Scarfs Large Squ... \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nCustomer Reviews \n4.6 out of 5 stars 132 \n\t\n— \n\t\n— \n\t\n5.0 out of 5 stars 2 \n\t\n5.0 out of 5 stars 2 \n\t\n4.1 out of 5 stars 5 \n\t\nPrice $8.90$8.90 \t$19.99$19.99 \t$15.99$15.99 \t$12.90$12.90 \t$9.90$9.90 \t$5.90$5.90 \t\nColor Optios 18 Colors \t5 Colors \t6 Colors \t5 Colors \t8 Colors \t25 Colors",
