        "username": "Emma",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AGKRTGUFEFLWKGLYOGQGCMJMQNVQ",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGKRTGUFEFLWKGLYOGQGCMJMQNVQ",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Gorgeous, Oversized, and Perfect for Layering!",
        "reviewDescription": "I absolutely love this Extra Large Russian Style Muffler Scarf! The 63 x 63 inch size makes it wonderfully oversized, perfect for draping, wrapping, or even wearing as a poncho. I got it in Black, and the floral print is gorgeous—bright, rich, and high-quality, with colors that really pop.The material is soft, breathable, and has a subtle shine, so it feels luxurious while still being durable. Even after multiple uses, the print hasn’t faded, which is impressive for the price. I’ve worn it as a scarf, a wrap, and even as a shawl over my shoulders, and it always looks elegant.This scarf is versatile, stylish, and practical—great for layering, travel, or gifting. Definitely a five-star purchase!",
        "date": "2025-09-07",
        "position": 1,
        "reviewedIn": "Reviewed in the United States on September 7, 2025",
