    "aPlusContent": {
      "title": "Product description",
      "rawText": "Product description\n\t\n2 PCS Long Chiffon Sheer Scarf \nColorful Scarf Wraps \nOld School Scarf Wraps \n27.5\" Silk Like Head Scarf \n27.5\" Silk Like Head Scarf \nExtra Large Russian Style Muffler \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nCustomer Reviews \n5.0 out of 5 stars 2 \n\t\n5.0 out of 5 stars 2 \n\t\n5.0 out of 5 stars 2 \n\t\n4.1 out of 5 stars 5 \n\t\n4.1 out of 5 stars 5 \n\t\n3.5 out of 5 stars 4 \n\t\nPrice $9.90$9.90 \t$9.90$9.90 \t$12.90$12.90 \t$5.90$5.90 \t$5.90$5.90 \t$12.90$12.90 \t\napply ✓ \t✓ \t✓ \t✓ \t✓ \t✓ \t\nSmilerSmile \nScarfs for Women Shawl Wrap for Evening Dressing Blanket Open Front Poncho Cape \nScarf Pashmina Shawl Wrap for Women，Long Large Thick Style Scarf Horse Scarves \nScarf 35.5 x 35.5 inch, Fashion Square Neck Scarf Head scarf for Women \nWomen Soft Scarf Shawl Long Scarf, Scarf and Wrap, Big Head Scarf \nMUTIPLE WEARINGS TO WEAR \nOur costumes can be used for shawls, scarves and neckers. Windshield, dust and warmth are all available. The material is soft and the texture is meticulous. You can mix and match freely without any worries. Inspire your artistic cells. \nBy the process of acrylic fiber, acrylic fiber has the smooth, soft and elastic feel . This product is more colorful than natural cashmere. \nScarf shawl exquisite print, detailed texture, vintage art pattern, are popular women like. \nTraditional folk scarf with flower print \nvarious colors for choose. \nSize: Print size is 35.5 x 35.5\" Tassel lenth is 4.75\" each side, so total scarf size is 44.5 x 44.5\" \nWeight: Approx 150 g \nCASUAL AND FORMAL OCCASIONS \nOn a cool summer night, when you sit on the sofa and watch a movie, it can used as a blanket bring you comfort. \nIf you need to sit in the air-conditioned room for a long time to work or study, it can help you prevent colds and make you feel comfortable. \nWhen wearing Extree scarf to play. The easy-to-carry scarf is very soft and comfortable. Decorate and take photos to show you are happy. \nSpring, Summer, Autumn and Winter wear, regardless of season \nPRODUCT FEATURE \nMultipul color for choice \nSuitable for all kinds of people \nThere are many ways to wear the scarf. \nMother's Day gifts\nBirthday wish him/her\nAnniversary\nChristmas gifts\nThanksgiving\nValentine's Day",
