  "description": "Fashion Windproof Faux Fur Cossack Style Russian Women Winter Ski Hat  Specifications: Material: Faux Fur Packing Includes: 1 x Fuzzy Hat  Features: touches soft,warm and cozy, thick and comfortable. The hat will add fun and style to any winter outfit. Unisex design makes the hat fit both women men. Use a exquisite and fanshionable design,make you looks amazing and fabulous. The Russion style allows you to look good when its cold out. The caps will keep you warm in the cold winter. Beautiful soft slouchy fuzzy hat for women winter, fashion and cute, you can match it with different styles of clothing. Easy to pair with women's winter clothes. Wear for the weather in style with a attractive look to jacket or sweaters.  Application: You can use it in many occasions, such as running, jogging, dancing and more. The excellent Cossack Russian style hat is very suitable for women, men take photos, daily wear, parties, shopping, skiing, traveling, outdoor sports, etc. Suitable for outdoor activities, skiing, snowboarding, camping. Good gift for your lover, family, friends on New Year, Birthday, Christmas, Thanksgiving, Holiday, party, Halloween and so on.  Note: As a viewer of different computers, the color will have a small difference compared to the images Please allow slight dimension difference due to different manual measurement (1 inch=2.54cm, 1 cm= 0.39 inch, 1cm=10mm )",
