    "slogan": "RussClothing"
  },
  "description": "This Cossack shirt is inspired by popular folk dancing. Handmade, skilful woven decoration from Ukraine has geometric, floral and animalistic ornaments. The traditional folk shirt is made of 100% linen and decorated with geometric trim. Old ornaments on the ethnic clothing have a new translation in today life. This set is great for performing Cossack (Hopak) dance! Stylish casual wear. Material: 100% linen Note: Belt included. Embroidery color and pattern may differ from the shown on the pictures",
