{
  "image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614hrr3eVsL._AC_SY445_SX342_QL70_ML2_.jpg",
  "url": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C72CDYY",
  "name": "Russsian dress traditional dance costume red sarafan folk clothing",
  "offers": {
    "price": 2548.55,
    "priceCurrency": "ZAR"
  },
  "brand": {
    "slogan": "RussClothing"
  },
  "description": "This Russian fancy dress looks stylish and perfect on every lady! The Russian folk dance is popular all over the world thanks to the elegant, smooth movements. This is an adult version of our most popular sarafan dress. The Russian dance costume consists of a white blouse and a circle sarafan and a kokoshnik headpiece. The costume goes perfect for Russian dancing thanks to a short, knee length and a circle skirt. Such Russian dresses can be designed for bigger sizes as well per individual request. Today Russian costume with a sarafan is still worn at holidays and special occasions. Sarafan is traditionally decorated with embroidered ornaments to protect a woman against the evil spirits: the vertical line - to protect the stomach, and the bottom horizontal line - to protect the legs. We design our Russian costumes taking into consideration the choreography and stage requirements. Any Russian clothing can be customized to your needs. Design: Soft silhouette Contents: safaran dress with a blouse &kokoshnik headpiece Material: gabardine cotton Attention: Knee length",
