        "username": "Olivia Poe",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AEBCJLK4WBVF24433EDQAEZHXFJA",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEBCJLK4WBVF24433EDQAEZHXFJA",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Fits my haunted doll!",
        "reviewDescription": "The media could not be loaded.\n                \n            \n                \n            \n            \n        \n    \n    \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    This doll gown fit my 18 inch tall Bellywyn the cat from the Love and Roses collection by Wendy Brent. It is beautiful and very well made. This offering shall bring me and my family peace, ensuring our safety from the spirit referred to as Bellywyn; until the chaotic entity that possesses this doll comes to me again, once more requiring that I purchase more high quality ball gowns for its physical porcelain prison else me and my family be cursed for the next 1,000 generations. I must appease the spirit known as Bellywyn, for no one else will take the doll... for my sanity and the safety of my family I am overjoyed with the absolute quality of this dress. I really enjoy the frills and how poofy the skirt is. 5 stars highly recommend.",
