        "reviewTitle": "Fashion Queen",
        "reviewDescription": "This dress has made my OG doll a Queen! Gorgeous! The dress came with a bow as described but I decided to use a crown and gold shoes that I had on hand. Definitely recommend!",
        "date": "2024-02-22",
