  "description": "Russian costume Contents: Shirt, pants & belt Material: cotton & gabardine Attention: Russian hat is not included This Russian costume for men looks so great that can be used for any occasion! Birthday, culture festivals, folk dances or theatre performance. Such traditional Russian shirt will go perfect for any event and even as Russian halloween costume. Russian shirt is inspired by long history of Russia. This traditional Russian kosovorotka is made of 100% cotton and decorated with the contrast embroidered trim. The Russian traditional costume includes: a folk shirt, Russian pants called ''porty'' & a long belt.",
