  "description": "Funny Russia Pelmeninator print for fans of Russian cuisine. Pelmeni are meat filled dumplings and taste delicious. Do not mistake them for Manti and Chebureki. Pilmeni are your favourite dish? likes them too. For all Russians who love traditional Russian cuisine. The Babushka makes the best pelmeni and borsch. Every likes shashlik and pelmeni. Russian cooking and delicious food. Russia original.",
