    "aPlusContent": {
      "title": "Product description",
      "rawText": "Product description\nAbout Svitanak \nSVITANAK is a belarusian manufacturer and marketer of everyday basic apparel. We sell, men's underwear, children's underwear, T-shirts, sweatshirts and other activewear. \nFamily business Founded in 2008, Svitanak has a long history of product excellence, and brand recognition. We try to use only natural fabrics in our clothes.our clothes undergo quality control and only then get to you. Thank you for choosing our products. \nOwn production \nWe make our own clothes. Only our own production. We do not buy products from third-party manufacturers. Our clothing company creates new and standard designs by itself. This is how we achieve high-quality tailoring. \n\nWe use only ecologically clean materials with high hygienic values and excellent consumer properties. \nWe at SVITANAK have both the skilled workforce and modern machinery. \nCotton is a universal fabric that can be made thin, in order to be breezy for summer, or thick so it can hold up to the elements of winter. It’s also a great alternative for people who have allergies to fabrics like wool. It’s fairly durable, but it is also a very breathable fabric and is very soft. \nWhen the outside temperature rises to a critical level your tee needs to breathe. The properties of this tee help with both moisture-wicking and temperature control. \nComfortable to wear on the beach, street, or in the city—SVITANAK wonderful fit any lifestyle without limits.",
