        "ratingScore": 3,
        "reviewTitle": "Very Thin Material",
        "reviewDescription": "The sizes are smaller than indicated.  I first ordered a 2X which was too small.  I subsequently ordered a 3X and it fit fine (perhaps a little too large).  I air dry the shirt after laundering it because I’m concerned that it will shrink in the dryer.  I wouldn’t order it again.",
