        "userProfileLink": null,
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Love these long sleeve shirts",
        "reviewDescription": "These are your traditional Russian armed services under shirt. They are thin, soft and made of cotton. They dry out quickly when wet and I absolutely love them. Only thing to note is that the “collar”/ neck hole(lack of a better word) on these long sleeves shirts are oval shape with pointy ends - horizontally the furthest points to the shoulders. It’s an odd look, so I would suggest perhaps googling an image of the area mentioned above. They are made in Belarus, never used and are brand new. I own several pairs. Highly recommended. As a reference, I am male, 5’9” height, weighing 250lbs. I wear a size xl which fits me well.",
