  },
  "brand": {
    "slogan": "Generic"
  },
  "description": "Patriotic Commemorative Alloy Brooch Traditional Russian Ribbon Symbol Secure Attachment For Historical ReenactmentsFeatures: Using the themed ribbon charm, symbolizing the solemnity and glory of the Russian War Memorial Day. The alloy endows the badge with sturdy and durability characteristics, making it suitable for history enthusiasts and collectors to wear on special occasions, showcasing profound cultural charm. Quality alloy, ensuring that the badge will not fade or deform for a long time. Suitable for long-term wear or display, meeting users' demand for long-lasting aesthetics. Convenient to wear structural design, easily fixed to clothing without tools, allowing you to quickly showcase your charm in any occasion. Suitable for multiple occasions, whether it's anniversary celebrations, themed parties, or daily outfits, this badge can add a unique charm to your clothing. It is not only an accessory, but also a inheritance to history. Suitable for educators, historical use, and other groups, it is used in classroom teaching or cultural exchange to stimulate a deeply understanding and reflection on historical event.Specifications: Component: alloyType: refer pictures to selection pleaseSize: Please refer to the product detail page for specific sizesPackage Includes: 1Pc Russian War Memorial Ribbon Brooch Badge PinNote: Please allow 1-2cm errors due to manual measurement. Please allow for slight color differences due to different display resolution.",
