{
  "image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oJdc4G6FL._AC_SX342_SY445_QL70_ML2_.jpg",
  "url": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F9LNXPGQ",
  "name": "Спаси и Сохрани Hoodie – Save and Protect Cyrillic Hoodie – Russian Orthodox Calligraphy Sweatshirt Unisex",
  "offers": {
    "price": 49.75,
    "priceCurrency": "$"
  },
  "brand": {
    "slogan": "Generic"
  },
  "description": "This unisex hoodie features the sacred phrase “Спаси и Сохрани” (Save and Protect) in authentic Church Slavonic script — the lettering famously used in Orthodox icons, grave crosses, and monastic manuscripts. Designed to honour spiritual protection and Slavic tradition, the hoodie blends cultural reverence with modern streetwear. Made from a soft cotton blend with a classic fit and front pocket, it’s wearable heritage. Symbolic, bold, and deeply meaningful — this piece speaks without saying a word. Ships worldwide. Limited stock.",
