  "image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MA2Byx38L._AC_SX342_SY445_QL70_ML2_.jpg",
  "url": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F146R2KH",
  "name": "Russia Football Jersey RS-77 Russian Flag",
  "offers": {
    "price": 9972.99,
    "priceCurrency": "INR"
  },
  "brand": {
    "slogan": "UNITIF"
  },
  "description": "Unofficial Russia Jersey by UNITIF Celebrating Style, Culture and Sporting Passion Football is much more than just a sport that is a source of pride, passion and gathering for millions of people around the world. In Russia, football plays a key role as an expression of national unity, and this unofficial Russia shirt by UNITIF captures that spirit perfectly. Designed for fans and enthusiasts, this unisex jersey combines sophisticated design, homage to Russian cultural heritage and modern functionality, making it an ideal choice for any sports or fashion enthusiast. Design steeped in tradition and history The choice of design of this jersey goes far beyond aesthetic considerations. Each visual element tells a story. The vibrant red color dominating the jersey is a direct nod to Russia's history and its flag. Red symbolizes strength, courage and determination – essential qualities on the football field and in everyday life. The floral patterns subtly printed on the fabric are inspired by traditional Russian folk art, including the Khokhloma style, famous for its detailed patterns and timeless elegance. These patterns, which include leaves, flowers and interlacing, pay tribute to Russian craftsmanship while adding a sophisticated visual dimension to the jersey. They also embody the natural beauty of Russia, with its vast forests, picturesque landscapes and rich biodiversity. The gold, present on the sides of the jersey and in certain details, brings a royal and refined touch. In Russia, walleye is often associated with the grandeur and splendor of imperial palaces and Orthodox churches. Here it is used to enhance the overall elegance of the jersey and make it a truly unique piece. A tribute to national identity On the chest, two elements immediately attract attention: the inscription \"RUSSIA\" and a golden emblem inspired by traditional Russian symbols. This stylized logo, although not official, recalls the coat of arms of Russia, with a strong symbolism of unity and national pride. Together, these elements create a jersey that not only looks aesthetically pleasing, but also embodies the spirit of the country and the love of its supporters for their team. The sleeves of the jersey subtly incorporate the colours of the Russian flag – blue, white and red – in the form of delicate stripes. These discreet yet meaningful details reinforce national identity while remaining stylish and modern. A jersey designed for comfort and performance from UNITIF is not limited to an attractive design, but also designed to meet the demands of fans and sports enthusiasts. Whether you wear it to cheer on your team at a game, for your training sessions or simply as everyday wear, it ensures optimal comfort. High-quality materials The fabric used for this jersey is a blend of lightweight and breathable technical fibres, designed to adapt to any situation. This material effectively wicks away moisture, ensuring that the wearer stays dry even on the hottest days or during intense physical activity. In addition, the softness of the fabric provides a pleasant contact with the skin, preventing irritation and ensuring prolonged comfort. Unisex ergonomic fit With its modern and ergonomic cut, this jersey is suitable for both men and women. It adapts to any body shape, providing a flattering silhouette without compromising freedom of movement. The V-neck adds a contemporary touch, while enhancing neck comfort. Durability and Easy Care Made with durable materials, this jersey is built to last. Prints and graphic details are embedded directly into the fabric, meaning they won't fade over time or washes. In addition, the jersey is easy to care for, it can be machine washed without the risk of fading or deformation. A versatile piece for any occasion This Russian jersey is not just a stadium garment. Its versatility makes it an ideal piece for a variety of settings, whether it's supporting your favorite team, playing sports, or simply expressing your personal style. For matches and gatherings Whether you're attending a live match, following it from home, or joining friends in a sports bar, this jersey is the perfect way to show your support for the Russian team. Its unique design ensures that you will stand out in the crowd while proudly displaying your colors. For training and sports activities Thanks to its technical materials, this jersey is also suitable for training sessions or outdoor sports activities. It gives you the comfort and freedom of movement you need to perform at your best, whether on a football field, in the gym or when jogging. For a casual and stylish look Outside of sporting events, this jersey can be integrated into a casual outfit. Pair it with jeans or shorts for a sporty and trendy look that reflects your passion for football and your admiration for Russian culture. The cultural impact of the UNITIF UNITIF jersey does not just produce jerseys. The brand strives to create pieces that tell a story and resonate with each country's values and traditions. This shirt from Russia, with its folk motifs and patriotic details, is a great example of this approach. This is not just a piece of clothing, but a symbol of national pride and a tribute to Russian history and culture. In a world where football is often a universal language, this jersey strengthens the links between fans and their country. It transcends the boundaries of sport to become a means of cultural and personal expression. Why choose UNITIF for your football jersey? As a brand dedicated to creating high-quality unofficial jerseys, UNITIF stands out for its commitment to design, functionality and fan satisfaction. Each piece is designed with care, focusing on details that make all the difference. By choosing this jersey from Russia, you opt for: A unique design: A jersey that stands out for its aesthetics and originality. A durable product: Designed to stand the test of time, using high-quality materials and prints. VERSATILE CLOTHING - Ideal for sports, events or casual wear. A cultural celebration: A tribute to the history and traditions of Russia.",
