    "features": [
      "4-PACK BURP CLOTHS SET: You will get two pieces of muslin burp cloths printed with cute designs, they are perfect for baby boys and baby girls, and can help you and your baby stay close and comfortable, so you can enjoy better bonding time.",
      "SUPER SOFT: Our burp cloths are made of high quality cotton muslin fabric, 4 layers of cotton muslin design makes them softer, they are thick and absorbent, the comfortable fabric is very skin-friendly, using our burp cloths to wipe your baby's sensitive skin is very safe and durable.",
      "LARGE SIZE: Measuring 22\" x 11\", our cotton burp cloths comfortably provide maximum coverage that rests perfectly on your shoulder and won't slide. The bottom terry cloth is laminated with TPU waterproof film to prevent penetration of the bottom layer and absorb moisture without seeping, preventing baby burps and spit-ups from soiling mom's clothes and baby's clothes, which is good for both mom and baby.",
      "MULTI-FUNCTIONAL: These burp cloths are perfect for toddlers, kids, boys and girls and it has various functions. Not only can they be used as burp cloths, but they can also be used as bibs, drool cloths, pillow cloths, etc. The top turn-stitched webbing can be used for hanging and easy storage, which is very convenient even for use on the go.",
      "PERFECT BABY GIFT: These super soft burp cloths are a thoughtful gift for the modern mom and dad. They will come in handy for parents on many occasions, taking the panic out of your baby's burps and spit-ups, a necessity for parents of newborns. They are gently machine washable and hold their shape well after washing."
    ],
