  "description": "MATERIAL Made of pure cotton muslin fabric, they provide a soft, thick, and absorbent cleaning tool that's perfect for your baby's skin.  COMFORTS They are designed to offer gentle cleansing without irritating your baby's delicate skin.  SIZE With a substantial size of 12x12 inches, they work well for various cleaning needs - from face wiping and bathing to hand and foot cleaning. They even serve as a convenient sweat cloth.  DESIGN Thanks to their solid stitching and meticulous hemming, these washcloths retain their shape and texture, even after multiple machine washes. With woven side handles, storage is easy, and space is saved.  Choose these Baby Washcloths for a convenient, durable, and gentle solution to keep your baby clean and happy.",
