    "features": [
      "Robust & Large Capacity: Featuring 2 premium storage bags, each with dimensions of 21.65x12.4x13.78 inches and a capacity of 60L, they offer ample space for your bedding, clothes, and other essentials, making them perfect for a variety of storage needs.",
      "Superior Material: Made from high-quality, more substantial fabric, these storage bags protect your items from damage and tears. The main body uses top-notch football grid fabric, and the clear window is made of durable PVC for easy visibility.",
      "Effortless Access: Equipped with a sturdy, double-way zipper, these clothes storage bags are designed for easy opening and closing, ensuring your items are secure yet accessible when you need them.",
      "Visibility Feature: The transparent window allows you to quickly see what's inside without unpacking, making it convenient to manage and access your stored items efficiently.",
      "Easy to Handle & Store: Designed with reinforced, durable handles for easy transportation and a foldable structure for minimal storage space usage. Great for use in closets, cloakrooms, and an excellent choice for dormitories, lofts, and bedrooms for optimal organization."
    ],
