  },
  "brand": {
    "slogan": "SDMKA"
  },
  "description": "Our tablecloths are made of high quality polyester, the fabric is thick, strong and durable. The surface is waterproof, stain-resistant and wrinkle-resistant, heat-resistant, can be used both outdoors and indoors, and can play a good role in protecting your table. The surface is designed with beautiful patterns, perfect for decorating your table. Can be used to add ambience for festivals. Easy to care, machine washable, multiple washings will not fade and wrinkle, reusable. Multiple sizes for your choice: 54x54 inches, 54x72 inches, 60x60 inches, 60x90 inches, 60x108 inches, 60x120 inches. (PLEASE NOTE: Please measure the size of your table before placing an order to avoid our tablecloths being too big or too small to be used properly.) If you have any questions related to this tablecloth, please feel free to contact us.",
