  "description": "GOODOLD muslin burp cloth emerges to make mothers and fathers more comfortable with their babies and more intimate with them. SPECIFICATION Material: cotton (contact surface) + tpu composite polyester (laminated cotton layer) Size: 22x11in (56x28cm) Printing: single-sided full printing Set: 1-piece / 2-piece set / 4-piece set FEATURES -Made of pure cotton cotton yarn fabric, 4 layers of cotton yarn, soft and thick, good water absorption, skin-friendly fabric. -Excellent craftsmanship, no frayed edges, top stitching webbing for hanging. -Bottom terry cloth compound TPU waterproof film to prevent penetration of the bottom layer, absorb water without seepage, effectively prevent clothes from getting dirty. WASHING INSTRUCTIONS Regular washing; less than 30 ℃ warm water washing; do not use bleach and other detergents; should not be soaked for a long time; can be hand-washed, ironing, gentle machine washable, not dry clean. SERVICE Our service aim is to provide high quality products and attentive service, if you have any product-related problems, please contact us, we will solve your problems and get your satisfaction. We would like to thank you for supporting our products, thank you.",
