    "importantInformation": null,
    "sustainabilityFeatures": null,
    "features": [
      "Ultimate Value Pack: Elevate your kitchen essentials with our dishcloth set, comes in a set of 6 with many color options. Each dishcloth measures a perfect 11 x 11 inches, versatility for all your cleaning needs.",
      "Premium Softness: Crafted from ultra-soft microfiber, our dishcloths are not only gentle on your hands but also on your dishes and countertops. The superior softness ensures comfortable and effective cleaning every time.",
      "Exceptional Absorbency: Say goodbye to ineffective cloths with our dish cloths designed for high absorbency. Perfect for drying dishes or wiping down surfaces, they make cleaning effortless and efficient.",
      "Durable & Reusable: Our kitchen cleaning cloths are built to last, capable of enduring multiple washes without losing their cleaning power. This makes them a sustainable choice that combines quality with eco-friendliness.",
      "Easy Care: Keeping your dishcloths clean and fresh is hassle-free. Suitable for both hand and machine wash, they retain their quality and effectiveness even after numerous washes, ensuring long-lasting use."
    ],
