    "features": [
      "High Quality Material: These baby washcloths are crafted with pure cotton muslin fabric, offering 4 layers of soft and thick material for the ultimate care of your baby's delicate skin.",
      "Practical Size: Measuring 12x12 inches, these muslin washcloths provide ample surface to cater to all your baby's cleaning needs, making them suitable for face wiping, bathing, hand and foot cleaning, and even as a sweat cloth.",
      "Skin-Friendly: With baby's skin comfort as a priority, these baby washcloths are designed to be gentle, reducing irritation and ensuring a soothing cleaning experience.",
      "Durable Design: Featuring solid stitching, these baby washcloths are made to last. The meticulous hemming keeps them in shape even after repeated washing.",
      "Convenient Usage: These muslin baby washcloths come with woven side handles for easy storage and can also be folded into a triangle to be used as a drool towel."
    ],
