    "features": [
      "SPACIOUS DESIGN: With a capacity of 14x 10x 8 inches, this storage basket provides plenty of space for storing a variety of items. It is suitable for a variety of storage compartments and shelves.",
      "DURABLE CONSTRUCTION: The basket's outer shell is made of durable canvas and the inner lining is made of 300DPE waterproof fabric. The top has a sturdy metal rod frame that supports the basket to keep its shape, making it a durable and quality storage basket.",
      "FOLDABLE AND SPACE SAVING: When not in use, this storage basket can be easily folded flat to save valuable space. The collapsible design with reinforced leather handles makes it easy to carry and store.",
      "EASY TO CLEAN: Not machine washable, we recommend hand washing this storage basket. The waterproof lining inside the storage basket makes it easy to clean, just wipe it with a damp sponge or cloth.",
      "VERSATILE USE: This multi-purpose storage box is ideal for organizing clothes, bags, towels, blankets, books and more. It is suitable for a variety of occasions, including bookshelves, closets, beds, desks, bathrooms, bedrooms, living rooms, studies and so on. Fun, fashionable and cute styles and colors can add a touch of fashion to any room."
    ],
