    "features": [
      "Polyester",
      "Material: The laundry backpack is made of oxford cloth, sturdy, tear-insulation, washable and waterproof.",
      "Size: 14.5 (diameter) x 29.3 Inch. This laundry bag is big enough for holding 2-3 loads of laundry.",
      "Upgraded Design: The drawstring design allows you to quickly store things, and easily take them out. The adjustable shoulder strap and webbing handle make it convenient to carry both by shoulder or hands. The inner pocket with zipper for storing cell phone, coins or cash change.",
      "Practical Laundry Hamper: It can not only be used to store clothes, towels and other sundries, but also can be used as a travel duffel bag or camping backpack. It can be hung on the door, bathroom, living room, bedroom, saving space for you.",
      "Perfect Present: Printed with beautiful and fashion patterns, the backpack is a creative present idea for a family, your mother, your father, co-worker, friends or yourself on any holiday."
