  },
  "description": "SPECIFICATION Material: Polyester Size: 11x11 inches (28x28 cm) Printing: One side printing (fixed beige on the bottom) Packing: Dishcloth *6 FEATURES Made of double-layer plush fabric, soft and comfortable to touch, excellent water absorption and hanging effect. Can easily clean up stains and grease. Easy to clean. APPLICABLE It can be used for kitchen dish cleaning and countertop scrubbing, etc. It is also very suitable for cleaning and wiping in any place such as automobile, utensils and home hygiene. WASHING INSTRUCTIONS Machine washable, hand washable, hang dry in shade. Please do not bleach. If you have any questions, please feel free to ask us.",
