    "highResolutionImages": [
      "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mM2XhlG8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg",
      "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B4l175FgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg",
      "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q7GrS6OFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg",
      "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YCd2gmgTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg",
      "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d4WV6I2NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg",
      "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RfkKUIC+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg",
      "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kTuLp-e3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg"
    ],
    "importantInformation": null,
    "sustainabilityFeatures": null,
    "features": [
      "SUPER SOFT KITCHEN TOWEL: Our premium dish cloths are made of high quality polyester material which is soft so they won't scratch your plates, cookware and pans. These dishcloths are great quality, durable, washable, reusable and a perfect alternative to kitchen paper towels and sponges. Very environmentally friendly.",
      "SUITABLE SIZE: Decorative kitchen towels are large enough, each kitchen towel measures about 28x18 inches, to help you with your daily kitchen activities. While cooking and baking, these dishcloths for cleaning are essential to keep your kitchen neat and tidy and make it a better place.",
      "MULTI-PURPOSE: These highly absorbent kitchen towels can be used not only for washing dishes, wiping plates and glasses, etc., but also for worktop cleaning, countertops, cookware, appliances, food spills, etc. It absorbs spills and splatters like magic. The unique kitchen towel combines decoration and practicality in one, and is also very suitable for the dining table as a napkin and decorative towel.",
      "EASY CARE: Each kitchen towel features a folded hem and a sewn webbing design on the back corner for easy hanging and drying. These dishcloths can be washed multiple times and become softer and more absorbent after successive washes, allowing you to meet your dishwashing, bathroom cleaning and surface wiping requirements with confidence.",
      "IDEAL GIFT: Each of these quality kitchen towels is printed with a unique and attractive pattern that will decorate your kitchen nicely, which looks great, it is an ideal gift for your mother, hostess, friends and colleagues as a housewarming, holiday, Christmas, Mother's Day, these soft and comfortable towels are sure to attract attention and compliments from all."
    ],
