  "description": "SPECIFICATION Material: Polyester Size: 28x18in / 71.1x45.7cm Package includes: 1*kitchen towel/ 4*kitchen towel/ 6*kitchen towel FEATURES -Cotton-like linen material, soft and comfortable fabric, durable. -Highly absorbent. -Back corner sewing webbing design, easy to hang. -Fine printing, beautiful overall, decorative and practical in one. APPLICABLE SCENES Kitchen, dishwasher table, dining table, etc. SERVICE We uphold the principle of quality first, if the product received is found to be damaged or does not meet your expectations, please contact us in a timely manner, we will reply to you as soon as possible and solve the problem for you until you are satisfied. We thank you very much for supporting our products, thank you and have a nice day.",
