      {
        "username": "Dr. Ann",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AE3RIQBTOJURFSYJPW24HCC7G4QA",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AE3RIQBTOJURFSYJPW24HCC7G4QA",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "large, sturdy, soft, very pretty",
        "reviewDescription": "I needed some accessories for a Polish-like outfit to wear as I carried the Polish flag in an Easter ceremony of prayer for the nations.  This scarf has the Polish folk colors and an Old World flair.  Along with a garland for my hair, it made the perfect accessory for my costume.  But it is also pretty and modern enough to make a nice scarf for other occasions.  So it is a worthwhile item for the price.  It is of a somewhat thick material, so it should hold up for many wearings.  It is also soft and comfortable, and very pretty.  Lots of compliments.",
