{
  "image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HEg-FUPOL._AC_SX342_SY445_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg",
  "url": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GCV37DHY",
  "name": "Neck Gaiter for Men Women, Multifunctional Neck Warmer For Stretchy Moisture Wicking, Motorcycle Riding Festival Workout, Personalized Traditional Russian Khokhloma",
  "offers": {
    "price": null,
    "priceCurrency": null
  },
  "brand": {
    "slogan": "Cozimangoe"
  },
  "description": "The ultimate accessory for any adventure. Our multifunctional headwear offers exceptional versatility with over 12 ways to wear it—transform it from a neck gaiter to a face mask, headband, bandana, balaclava, and more. Crafted from high-performance microfiber polyester, it's breathable, moisture-wicking, and quick-drying to keep you comfortable and dry during any activity. Our innovative seamless and non-hemmed edge design means no irritating seams or pressure points, offering superior elasticity and a soft, next-to-skin feel. Perfect for everything from dusty music festivals to windy mountain trails, it’s your go-to gear for protection, performance, and style.Product Type: Multifunctional HeadwearMaterial: 100% Microfiber PolyesterDimensions: Approx. 20\" x 10\" (50cm x 25cm)Design: Seamless Tubular ConstructionFeatures: Breathable, Moisture-Wicking, Wind & Dust Resistant, Quick-Dry, High-ElasticityCare Instructions: Hand wash recommended, water temperature below 104°F (40°C). Do not bleach. Avoid direct sun exposure.Target Group: UnisexPackage IncludesMultifunctional Headwear x 1If you looking for custom personalized patterns? Feel free to contact us, and we will create tailored home products according to your specific needs! Your satisfaction is our top priority—if you have any questions, reach out to us, and we will respond within one working day.",
