      "SIZE: Burp cloths measure 22x11 inches and are large and wide enough to effectively block dirt from coming into contact with your clothes.And with a variety of combinations (1 pcs, 2 pcs, 4 pcs), you are free to choose.",
      "Material:Our burp cloths are made of pure cotton cotton yarn, the fabric is soft and thick, very skin-friendly and won't hurt your baby's delicate skin.",
      "Good Water Absorption: This burp rag is designed with 4 layers of cotton yarn, which can absorb water quickly. The bottom of the burp rag is terry towel composite TPU waterproof membrane, which can effectively prevent penetration of the bottom layer, and can well protect the clothes from getting dirty.",
      "Thoughtful Design: The burp cloth is wrapped with a wraparound process that does not fray the edges, preventing it from hurting your baby's soft skin. There is a sewing webbing on the top, which can be hung when not in use, easy to store without taking up space. The recessed design in the center allows the burp towel to fit over the shoulder so that it is not easy to fall off when in use.",
      "Multi-Purpose: Not only is it a burp bib, the softness of the fabric and the absorbency of the fabric make it can also be used as a large sized drooling towel, pillowcase, etc., to keep the baby clean and tidy, one of the essential items for babies."
    ],
