  "description": "SPECIFICATION Printing: peripheral printing (bottom fixed black, lining fixed white). Material: external canvas, white PE coated fabric for lining, thick cotton rope for carrying handle. Size: 20 inches D, 14 inches H (50.8cm * 35.56cm). Capacity: 72 Liters. Washing: machine washing is not recommended, can be partially hand-washed. FEATURES *Large capacity can hold a week's worth of dirty clothes for a family of four. Makes housework easy. This large cotton storage basket can easily hold toys, clothes, blankets, towels, etc. *No support skeleton used, so it can be folded for storage when not in use. *Waterproof lining can also be used as a laundry basket. *Reinforced cotton rope handle makes transportation easier and more comfortable. *No sharp edges, safer for children to use. APPLICABLE SCENES Bedroom, children's room, closet, bathroom, living room, laundry room and any other place where there is a need to store items. SERVICE We are committed to providing customers with quality products, if our products do not meet your satisfaction, please do not hesitate to contact us directly, we will solve your problems until your satisfaction. Thank you for supporting our products, thank you! :):):)",
