    "importantInformation": null,
    "sustainabilityFeatures": null,
    "features": [
      "Extra Large Basket: Our Laundry Basket is made from high-quality canvas, with a waterproof lining for added convenience. Its large size of 20x20x14 inches offers an extra-large capacity to accommodate all your laundry needs.",
      "Multi-functional: This versatile storage basket is not only suitable for laundry but also serves as a multipurpose organizer. Use it to store baby items such as stuffed toys, blankets, or towels in the nursery or kid's room. It can also hold throw pillows, blankets, bedding, clothes, and more, keeping your home tidy and organized.",
      "Soft Handles: The reinforced cotton rope handles provide a comfortable grip, making it easy to carry the basket from one room to another.",
      "Unique Home Décor: With its stylish and chic design, our blanket storage basket adds a decorative touch to any room. Its versatile prints blends well with various room styles, including the nursery, living room, laundry room, family room, and bedroom.",
      "This basket is foldable, making it easy to store and save space when not in use. It's shipped in a folded form but quickly regains its elegant shape when filled with towels or blankets. Additionally, ironing can be done to remove any creases."
    ],
