          "type": "3p-module-b",
          "title": "Domachevо matryoshka doll in Belarusian folk dress with Slavic patterns is unique gift for slavic culture lovers or great as exemplar for collectors",
          "text": "Matryoshka Doll is a symbol of love, care, and strong relations between people. Nesting dolls are also known as Baboushka nesting dolls, Matryoshka dolls, Stacking dolls. \nEach babushka doll is hand-carved and hand-painted by an artist: \nNesting dolls wooden set includes 5 pcs;\nThe largest doll is 3.5\", the smallest is 0.8\"\nDolls made with fine materials: \nBlank nesting dolls are carefully made of natural wood;\nNesting dolls for kids hand-painted with high-quality water-based paints;\nFinished with deluxe varnish.\nWooden nesting dolls are a great home decoration and great gift idea: \nAdds soft decor accent to any interior;\nDurable and eye-catching;\nGreat educational toy and absolutely safe for kids;\nMatryoshka dolls will bring joy to children and adults, as it is fun to assemble and disassemble.\nIf you want to make a really unique and original gift, if you want to amaze and delight someone you care about - Nesting Dolls is an excellent choice! Babushka dolls are a wonderful and unique gift, suitable for any occasion, for example, Birthdays, Christmas gifts, Mother's Day, etc. Since Nesting Dolls are hand-carved and hand-painted items, no two sets will be exactly identical to the photos or each other. \nNOTE. Not recommended for kids under 3 years due to small parts inside. Recommended to remove two small dolls until the child is older.",
