{
  "image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/B1pppR4gVKL._CLa%7C2140%2C2000%7C91XBuOYGAzL.png%7C0%2C0%2C2140%2C2000%2B0.0%2C0.0%2C2140.0%2C2000.0_AC_SX342_SY445_QL70_FMwebp_.png",
  "url": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DJWFHS4S",
  "name": "Pelmeni Russian Traditional Comfort Food Dumpling T-Shirt",
  "offers": {
    "price": 17.99,
    "priceCurrency": "$"
  },
  "brand": {
    "slogan": "Pelmeni Dumpling Russian Comfort Food"
  },
  "description": "I'm Not Small I'm Pelmeni Size. This design is an ode to the Pelmeni Dumpling, a staple of Russian cuisine that brings comfort to many. The design brings to life the essence of traditional Russian comfort food, transporting you back to your grandma's kitchen. Embrace the nostalgia and feel the warmth of the homemade Pelmeni dumplings with every glance at this design. No matter where you are, this design keeps the memory of your favorite Russian dumplings alive. A perfect way to wear your love for Pelmeni and Russian culinary tradition on your sleeve.",
