  },
  "description": "Cute Russia girl in a traditional red folk dress with kokoshnik and flag details. Surrounded by daisies and poppies, this design highlights Russian heritage, pride, and cultural tradition. Perfect for cultural events, holidays, family gatherings, or everyday wear. A bright and joyful look for anyone who appreciates Russia, traditional clothing, and floral folk art. This Cute Russia Girl Traditional Folk Dress and Flowers for Kids item is designed by Russian Culture Apparel Folk Heritage Flag Art.",
