      {
        "username": "Anna",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AHQCTY25C7UBUVVRMRSX5W5FIHKQ",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHQCTY25C7UBUVVRMRSX5W5FIHKQ",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "This is georgeous and nicer than expected. I'm well pleased.",
        "reviewDescription": "The media could not be loaded.\n                \n            \n                \n            \n            \n        \n    \n    \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    This is a beautiful scarf.Tonight, I wore it tonight to wear with a wild west/ Victorian style costume that I'm working on.When I finish the costume, I'll be wearing it on my shoulders. It will definitely add a luxurious look to the whole thing.I am also glad to have it on hand to wear with formal outfites such as an upcoming senior citizen's prom.This scarf/shawl is well made.It is soft and looks expensive even though it isn't expensive at all. It is definitely a good buy for the money.The color is beautiful.It is a nice size.It is light weight.I wish I had on in every color.I highly recommend this.",
        "date": "2025-05-05",
