      },
      {
        "username": "Zann",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AHGLBCF7O4DYBC5Z3EGXPHIITZHA",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHGLBCF7O4DYBC5Z3EGXPHIITZHA",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "As Pictured",
        "reviewDescription": "This scarf/shawl is as pictured. The model must be very small through the shoulders because it doesn't drape as long or as far around on me, but it still works.The see through portions are sturdy but appear delicate. The fringe is not flimsy or cheap looking. The velvet portions are extremely soft. This looks like it cost way more than it did.I'd also say this is perfect for a table cover. It has a wonderful vintage appeal.",
