  "description": "Kosovorotka was main clothing for men for any occasion of their life. The simple style was always the same; the only difference was in the embroidery. The more important event was, the more beautiful and richer was the decoration. Highlighted with stylish embroidered ribbon at the collar and chest. A matching belt completes \"the look.\" The Russian shirt is individually made in Russia. Russian shirts kosovorotka are popular for folk festivals, Russian culture events etc. This kosovorotka shirt is made of high quality linen blend. Material: cototn/ linen blend Note: Belt included. Embroidery color and pattern may differ from the shown on the pictures",
