    "aPlusContent": {
      "title": "Product description",
      "rawText": "Product description\nHaiti Football Jersey by UNITIF: An Ode to Resilience and National Pride Disclaimer: This jersey is an independent creation, inspired by the symbols, history and culture of Haiti. It is not affiliated with any official organizations or teams. A vibrant tribute to the spirit of Haiti Haiti, a land of cultural richness and remarkable resilience, finds its essence encapsulated in this unique football jersey signed UNITIF. This jersey reflects the strength, pride and passion of the Haitian people through a bold and symbolic design. Designed for supporters, sports fans and lovers of Haiti, it is much more than just a piece of clothing: it is a true standard of national identity. A striking and symbolic design A color palette inspired by the Haitian flag The jersey harmoniously combines blue and red, the colors of the national flag of Haiti. These vibrant hues represent freedom and unity, respectively, values ​​that are essential to the Haitian people. A distinctive golden diagonal A golden stripe crosses the jersey diagonally, separating the blue and red sections. This detail adds a touch of sophistication to the design while symbolizing the light, hope and bright future of the country. Subtly integrated patterns In the background, tone-on-tone patterns, inspired by Haitian tropical flora and traditional symbols, add depth and texture to the design. These subtle elements pay homage to Haiti’s lush nature and cultural heritage. Meaningful emblems The coat of arms of Haiti: Placed on the left chest, this coat of arms proudly recalls Haiti’s national identity and glorious history. A second stylized crest: On the right chest, a modern emblem pays tribute to the fighting spirit and resilience of the Haitian people, a characteristic trait of the country. A jersey designed for performance and comfort UNITIF combines innovation and style to create a jersey that meets the needs of athletes while reflecting the aspirations of supporters. High-quality technical materials The fabric used for this jersey is lightweight, breathable and designed to provide optimal moisture management. Whether you are playing football or attending a match under the Caribbean sun, this jersey maximum comfort. An ergonomic and unisex cut Suitable for all body types, this unisex jersey has a modern and fitted cut. The elegant V-neck and slightly fitted sleeves offer great freedom of movement while highlighting the silhouette. Exceptional durability The patterns and colors are integrated into the fabric using advanced sublimation techniques. This method resistance to repeated washing, allowing the jersey to maintain its brightness and quality over time. A versatile garment for all occasions Express your national pride Whether you’re at the stadium, a fan rally or a community event, this jersey is the perfect way to show your love for Haiti. Its stylish and meaningful design attracts attention while reflecting your values. An ideal piece of equipment for sports activities Thanks to its technical properties, this jersey is perfectly suited for training, matches or any other physical activity. It optimal performance and exceptional comfort, allowing you to give your best. A casual and modern style Pair this jersey with jeans or casual pants for a chic and casual look. Whether it’s for an outing with friends, a walk or a relaxing day, this jersey is a perfect choice to combine style and symbolism. A tribute to Haitian history and culture Every detail of this jersey has been carefully thought out to reflect the history, values ​​and identity of Haiti. The national colors Blue and red, taken from the Haitian flag, symbolize freedom and unity respectively. These colours capture the essence of the nation and its people. The Golden Diagonal This unique golden stripe symbolises the hope and light that continue to inspire Haiti despite challenges. It also speaks to the country’s bright future. Tropical Motifs The background motifs recall Haiti’s natural wealth and cultural diversity, from lush mountains to idyllic beaches. National Emblems The coat of arms and modernised crest celebrate Haiti’s history and resilience, reinforcing the emotional connection between the jersey and its wearer.",
      "rawImages": [
        {
          "name": "unitif",
