      "Easy to Install :The Christmas tree skirt for home with red rope straps for easy installation, at opening to secure tree skirt in place under the tree, which can be tied up as a bow decoration, or it can be easily hidden under the tree skirt.",
      "Perfect Decoration: Xmas tree skirt can place on anywhere like living room, bedroom, garden, office, bar, hotel, supermarket, perfect Christmas indoor outdoor decorations,it is can will decorate your Christmas tree and add a romantic and festive warm atmosphere",
