      "rawText": "Product description\nUrban CoCo shawl wrap bohemia cardigans symbolize fashion and style.It lets your body curve in imperceptible in display,\nquite have the woman flavor. This shawl with bohemia and loose style is the perfect go to piece to spice up any outfit for any occasion.\nJust wrap yourself in the way you want to portray yourself and get multiple looks out of one dress. It's a real basic and will never go out of style.\n\n\nVersatile Poncho Wrap Shawl:\n\nLimitless options for wearing it, from casual to formal, thus creating impressive outlooks\nWear it free flowing, or with a belt to give it a more elegant look\nWear it as a shawl, blanket scarf or wrap it around for your everyday wear\n\nRich Colors & Graphic Design:\n\nThis poncho features an interesting graphic design, in rich colors\nAvailable in various colors, so you can find the one that best fits your preference and your style\nAre you ready to wear this amazing poncho to add some color to your outfit? Don't hesitate\n\nWarm & Suitable for all Occasions:\n\nComfortable and warm clothing to wear at various occasions\nWhilst working in the office, watching TV at your home, or take it with you in the car, take it to travel on the airplane\nWhen you need to be on the road during chilly nights,there are various ways that make you look incredibly fashionable and warm with this poncho\n\nSpecifications: \nItem Type: Poncho/Shawl/Wrap/Cardigans/Blanket Scarf/Ruana/Sweater/Coat\nGender: Women,Girls\nPattern Type: Floral Printed\nMaterial: 100% Polyester\nSize: US Free Size: Length 63~70-9/10 inch~~Width 51-1/5 inch\n\nWashing instructions: \nHand Wash Cold / Do Not Bleach / Dry Flat / Iron Low\n\t\nColor Block Shawl \nRetro Style Shawl \nVintage Pattern Shawl \nPrinted Tassel Shawl \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nCustomer Reviews \n4.3 out of 5 stars 353 \n\t\n4.6 out of 5 stars 4,991 \n\t\n4.5 out of 5 stars 1,961 \n\t\n4.5 out of 5 stars 9,637 \n\t\nPrice $32.80$32.80 \t$33.86$33.86 \t$31.86$31.86 \t$34.79$34.79 \t\nTassels no data \t✓ \tno data \t✓ \t\nSee More",
