      {
        "username": "GEEGEE",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AHTAQBA44RMCO6NTDVOHFBN3QXMA",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHTAQBA44RMCO6NTDVOHFBN3QXMA",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Comfortable, keeps the wind out, and love the beautiful, muted Southwest pink and green colors.",
        "reviewDescription": "I enjoy not having the hassle of putting a coat on.  It has kept me relatively warm even in this cold Kansas winter.  For those who think the colors are too muted, the soft pastels are the colors of the Southwest.  Also for complaints that the material was too heavy, they must have changed the material because my poncho is quite light weight.  When we dine out in usually chilly restaurants, I can either keep the poncho over my shoulders or draped across my legs. The material is not itchy but it does wrinkle a little when I don’t always hang it up or fold it carefully.  I am thoroughly enjoying this soft green/pink poncho but it does make me a bit homesick for the SW where I was born and raised.",
        "date": "2026-01-30",
        "position": 1,
        "reviewedIn": "Reviewed in the United States on January 30, 2026",
        "reviewId": "R1ERMQK1IOJMPH",
        "reviewUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/customer-reviews/R1ERMQK1IOJMPH/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?ie=UTF8",
        "reviewImages": [],
        "reviewReaction": null,
        "isVerified": false,
        "isAmazonVine": false,
        "avatar": null,
        "variant": "Color: Series 2-green",
        "variantAttributes": [
          {
            "key": "Color",
            "value": "Series 2-green"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "username": "Rev Marcy",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AETL5AIRJWAKHBZ6UMQTGHIS2GPA",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AETL5AIRJWAKHBZ6UMQTGHIS2GPA",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Beautiful big bright comfy shawl.",
        "reviewDescription": "Wow. I love this. I work from home having lots of online meetings. If I don’t feel like wearing a dressy shirt or it’s a bit chilly in my office, this looks great on video meetings. It’s great around town too. It’s very comfortable. I usually prefer cotton but even though this is polyester it is soft and not scratchy. The quality is actually nicer than I expected. The pattern is bright and beautiful without being loud. Mine is purple and green -a combination I love. It washed well in the machine on delicate and I dried it half way on delicate as well for about 10 minutes and hung it to dry the rest of the way. It came out great -no shrinking or pilling. I’m built big and this one size fits most is more than generously cut for me. It’s big without being bulky at all. And it packs well for travel or storage-  folded into a flat square, it doesn’t wrinkle and it takes up very little room. I love mine and will give other patterns as gifts. I’ll even gift myself a different pattern as well. Highly recommend.",
        "date": "2026-01-31",
        "position": 2,
        "reviewedIn": "Reviewed in the United States on January 31, 2026",
        "reviewId": "R2MZHXPPPQU6H0",
        "reviewUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/customer-reviews/R2MZHXPPPQU6H0/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?ie=UTF8",
        "reviewImages": [],
