      {
        "username": "Sheri D.",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AHIYRR3GJOSFH2GQLI44GXOS4L5A",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHIYRR3GJOSFH2GQLI44GXOS4L5A",
        "ratingScore": 4,
        "reviewTitle": "Great light-weight Women’s Poncho (ordering more!)",
        "reviewDescription": "I ordered this poncho because my 22 year old son has several ponchos he purchased on his trips to Mexico. I borrowed one of his one somewhat cool evening we were all sitting out on the back patio, by the pool. I was surprised how warm his kept me. So I saw these colorful ponchos and decided to try one out. I’m very pleased with this poncho from Amazon. It’s just warm enough for the cool evenings in Southern California (temps in the mid to low 60’s at night). It keeps me just as warm as my go-to big pullover sweatshirt, but farrrr more stylish!! These are made in China (NOT México) and are synthetic (NOT Cotton) and they’re thinner (finer?) woven compared to the ponchos from Mexico, but they’re great! I’m going to order several more in different colors to have on hand for guests! So when the girls come over, they can have one too! (We SoCal girls love to enjoy the outdoors, but just don’t “wanna” be COLD! 😃)  These would be great in any part of the country, sitting around a fire pit, etc. (Think I’ll bring it with me when we go skiing this winter too!  I would recommend these as a gift as well, or just “for you.” The only reason I gave it 4 Stars was because it was a little thinner than what I was expecting. The colors are great though!  I ordered the turquoise one and am very happy with the colors it offers! Looking forward to having the girls over for wine and cheese by the pool and we all will be wrapped in colorful warmth!!",
        "date": "2019-06-30",
        "position": 4,
        "reviewedIn": "Reviewed in the United States on June 30, 2019",
        "reviewId": "R1TOBP4M3IP86E",
        "reviewUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/customer-reviews/R1TOBP4M3IP86E/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?ie=UTF8",
