      {
        "username": "Amazon Customer",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AEY7U7RLLLQLJSSXY555NUKR46KA",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEY7U7RLLLQLJSSXY555NUKR46KA",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Lovely, But Colors Are Different From Pictures",
        "reviewDescription": "It's larger/roomier than I thought it would be (I'm 5'7\", 140 lbs), but that's fine.I bought \"series 2- blue\" and \"series 2- pink\".The colors in the picture are not completely accurate. In the pictures, the colors are brighter.The \"pink\"that looks like hot pink in the picture is actually a deep, vibrant violet (I love it. It's very pretty), and the turquoise color in the \"blue\" picture is indeed turquoise, but it's a bit darker and more muted (which is fine).It's super comfortable and I love them!",
