      {
        "username": "Cranberry",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AEHYBHTP5YVQZK4FTJJAWFDZ2XWA",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEHYBHTP5YVQZK4FTJJAWFDZ2XWA",
        "ratingScore": 3,
        "reviewTitle": "Beautiful Soft Shawl However...",
        "reviewDescription": "This is a beautiful, colorful and soft shawl. I love the color combination, ethnic design and it washed well. However this shawl will snag on everything even the slightest pull will cause it into rip and tear. On the first day I put this shawl on I was elated by the presentation, color and supposed quality. I work in a building that has the AC on high. So looking for quality easy to remove outerwear like a shawl I am always on the search for. But this shawl snags and tears from the slightest tug or pull. Even putting on a seat belt and the slight friction of the seat belt will cause this shawl to rip and tear little to eventually big holes that run. Love this item but did not expect to wear it more than once people ! Due to its easy rip and tear and snag factor. Buyer beware! This buyer is currenntly experiencing buyers remorse!!!",
