        "userProfileLink": null,
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Super cute--vibrant, and completely reversible!",
        "reviewDescription": "What a fabulous cape this is--and what a fabulous price! It has no tags so there's a mystery as to what type of fabric it is, I'm guessing acrylic though it's more like a wool blanket type feel, really nice and warm, and long enough to fit taller people well. I'm a size 1X/ and this fits me fine, have added a few pictures which show the true colour. Everything I have on today--including a Sakkas dress and a sweater and tights--came from Amazon. :)Here's the best part--because it has no tags, it's fully reversible and just as pretty on the inside as the outside. Well made--I'd wash it carefully and maybe not dry in the dryer-- though I have read some reviews who have and it hasn't shrunk (which leads me to think acrylic--but not that type of acrylic that pills)Really nice, great price, I immediately went back and bought the blue, too!",
