  "description": "Traditional Waist Belt Russian Caucasus Costume Crystal Belt for Stage Elegant Cosplay Costume WaiststrapFeatures:Immersing yourself in the cultural of the Caucasus with this authentic Russian Caucasian Ethnic Robe Belt, a masterpieces of traditional craftsmanships and ancient detailing.Use selected metal, this belt with durability and comfortable, featured exquisited ancient embellishments that accentuate its luxurious and unique styles.Great for collector and enthusiasts of ethnic cultural artifact, individuals fascinated by Caucasian, and those who appreciate wearing traditional costume.Perfect for cultural festival, stage themed parties, or as a wedding gift that respects ethnic tradition.This ethnic robe belt serves as a great accessory and bridge connecting modern fashion with the rich tapestry of Caucasian history and culture.Specifications:Texture: MetalProduct Dimension: Approx. Width 3.3cm/1.3inch, length 103cm/40.55inchColor Option: 01/02/03/04Package Includes:1PC Waist BeltNote:Please allow 1-2cm error due to manual measurement.Due to the differences between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item.",
