      "rawText": "Product description\nThe video showcases the product in use.The video guides you through product setup.The video compares multiple products.The video shows the product being unpacked.\nRomanstii Long Sleeve Shirts\nMerchant Video\nMore Stylish Ideas from buyers \nMore Stylish Ideas from buyers \nPerfect summer shirts is great for work, beach, office, travel, holiday, vacation, party, club and dating. \nVideo Show from Buyers \nBlue Leopard Print Tops for Women \nBuyer Show Video \n\nPerfect summer shirts is great for work, beach, office, travel, holiday, vacation, party, club and dating. \nThe video showcases the product in use.The video guides you through product setup.The video compares multiple products.The video shows the product being unpacked.\nBlue Leopard Print Top\nMerchant Video\nThe video showcases the product in use.The video guides you through product setup.The video compares multiple products.The video shows the product being unpacked.\nvideo\nMerchant Video\nPeacock Blue Long Sleeve Dressy Top for Women \nBuyer Show Video \n\nPerfect summer shirts is great for work, beach, office, travel, holiday, vacation, party, club and dating. \nHot Pink Shirts \nBuyer Show Video \n\nThe video showcases the product in use.The video guides you through product setup.The video compares multiple products.The video shows the product being unpacked.\nvideo\nMerchant Video\nThe video showcases the product in use.The video guides you through product setup.The video compares multiple products.The video shows the product being unpacked.\nDressy Casual Floral Shirts for Women\nMerchant Video\nNavy Floral Tops for Women \nBuyer Show Video \n\nBlue Floral V-Neck Long Sleeve Tops for Women \nBuyer Show Video \n\nThese long sleeves blouses are available in a variety of solid colors, floral printed, stripes, polka dots, etc. Any style is a wardrobe must-have item. \nThe video showcases the product in use.The video guides you through product setup.The video compares multiple products.The video shows the product being unpacked.\nvideo\nMerchant Video\nThe video showcases the product in use.The video guides you through product setup.The video compares multiple products.The video shows the product being unpacked.\nvideo\nMerchant Video\nBrown Blouses for Women \nBuyer Show Video \n\nMore Details of This Blouses \nSize Chart \nDue to manual measurement, please allow 0.1-0.3inch error. \nMore Most-Wished Tops From Our Brand \n\t\nWomens Long Sleeve Shirts \nAdd to Cart \nStriped Collared Sweater \nAdd to Cart \nRed 3/4 Sleeve Blouse \nBuying Options \n3/4 Length Sleeve Tops \nBuying Options \nSleeveless Tank \nAdd to Cart \nPuff Sleeve Tops \nAdd to Cart \nCustomer Reviews \n\t\n4.4 out of 5 stars 5,276 \n\t\n4.4 out of 5 stars 517 \n\t\n4.2 out of 5 stars 109 \n\t\n4.2 out of 5 stars 109 \n\t\n4.4 out of 5 stars 601 \n\t\n4.3 out of 5 stars 6,351 \n\t\nPrice \n\t$14.99$14.99 \t$26.99$26.99 \t— \t— \t$14.99$14.99 \t$8.99$8.99 \t\nSleeve Type \n\tLong Sleeve \tLong Sleeve \t3/4 Length Sleeve \t3/4 Length Sleeve \tSleeveless \tPuff Sleeve \t\nCollar \n\tV-Neck \tPolo Collar \tV-Neck \tV-Neck \tV-Neck \tV-Neck \t\nPattern \n\tFloral \tStriped \tSolid \tAbstraction Print \tFloral \tPolka Dot \t\nSeason \n\tSpring/Summer/Fall/Winter \tFall/Winter \tSpring/Summer \tSpring/Summer \tSummer \tSummer \t\nSoft \n\t✔ \t✔ \t✔ \t✔ \t✔ \t✔",
