      {
        "username": "sherri henry chesnut",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AHQ6WQYMPRAGUHDZT4VXLKB55IVQ",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHQ6WQYMPRAGUHDZT4VXLKB55IVQ",
        "ratingScore": 4,
        "reviewTitle": "Lovely, but a little small and does wrinkle",
        "reviewDescription": "Lovely scarf.  Comes with a very nice color cardstock enclosure card with drawings and instructions for eight different scarf / knot designs, such as French Knot, Maple Knot, etc.  However, as silk, the scarf does wrinkle.  And the scarf was a little small.  The scarf is supposed to be 21\" square  .. but the one I received was 20\" - 20.5\" square.  My favorite scarf is 22\" .. so I miss the extra 1-2\".  The scarf comes folded in a nice little clear plastic pouch, so it's gift-ready.  Perfect size and packaging to put inside a gift bag or box, or even inside a large greeting card.  It's super nice and lovely, especially for gift-giving.  Fabulous small gift.  But, I'd have been happier if it had been a little larger ~ at least the 21\" square it was supposed to be.",
        "date": "2024-07-19",
