    "priceCurrency": "MUR"
  },
  "brand": {
    "slogan": "Croogo"
  },
  "description": "Introducing the Croogo Winter Russian Hat – where classic function meets playful, unique design. Crafted for those who appreciate both warmth and style, this hat redefines winter gear with two wearable styles. For ultimate outdoor protection, wear it with the ear flaps down, secured by the practical chin cord. Prefer a more fashionable look? Simply fold the flaps up into the hat and fasten them with the interior button strap to transform it into a trendy Ushanka-style cap.Our hat stands out with its premium corduroy exterior and short, foldable brim. Roll the brim up to reveal the delicate Croogo embroidery – a signature detail that showcases quality and adds a cute, distinctive flair. The soft polyester lining ensures warmth and comfort, while the adjustable back drawstring (fits 22\"-23\" head circumference) and detachable chin cord offer a personalized, windproof fit.Built for winter adventures, this versatile hat is your reliable companion for skiing, camping, hiking, or casual strolls. It’s more than just a winter accessory – it’s a statement of practicality and playful design.Croogo – Designed to Be Noticed, Built to Keep You Warm.",
