  "brand": {
    "slogan": "LFRXION"
  },
  "description": "Classical Cold Weather Trapper Hat Soft Plush Lining Full Day Comfortable Russian Hat for Family Outings Snow SportFeatures:Engineered with thickened plush fleece and upgraded earflaps, this earflap hat delivers great cold weather protections while maintaining breathability for winter sport enthusiasts and daily commuters.Featuring polyester lining and widened windproof ear covers, the hat combine traditional inspired design with modern comfort for extended wear without skin irritations or pressure.Great for adult, and outdoor adventurers seeking great head warmth during skiing, cycling, or family winter travel in extreme temperatures.Perfect for mountain hikes, city commutes, or snow playgrounds activity, its unisex design suited seamlessly to both casual outfit and professional winter gear ensemble.With reinforced stitching and earflaps, this cold weather head accessory ensures full family comfort across generation while preserving retro aesthetic.Specifications:Component: PolyesterProduct Size: As pictures shownColor: 01/02/03/04Package Includes:1PC Winter HatNote:Please allow 0-1cm error due to manual measurement.Due to the differences between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color the item",
