      {
        "username": "hungry",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AGKK5O7BEUJPAR47IO2MGKGGDZFQ",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGKK5O7BEUJPAR47IO2MGKGGDZFQ",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Fit and feels great",
        "reviewDescription": "This QIUTIMIY pashmina scarf is absolutely stunning. Both in quality and design. The blend of viscose, acrylic, and silk feels luxuriously soft, lightweight, and breathable, with a beautiful sheen that catches the light. It drapes elegantly and instantly elevates any outfit, whether you’re dressing up or keeping it casual.I love the double sided jacquard pattern. Each side has a slightly different color tone, giving you two looks in one. The craftsmanship is excellent, and the material feels durable without being heavy. It’s also generously sized, making it easy to wear as a shawl, wrap, travel blanket, or head scarf.Perfect for any season . Cozy in winter and light enough for summer evenings. It also makes a wonderful gift thanks to its elegant design and versatility. Highly recommend for anyone who wants a fashionable, high quality, and multi purpose pashmina.",
        "date": "2025-10-15",
        "position": 1,
        "reviewedIn": "Reviewed in the United States on October 15, 2025",
        "reviewId": "R3SPSCPWPX444J",
