        "userId": "amzn1.account.AFHKVPAJN3FMQGPRNKAZYNRTWAJA",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFHKVPAJN3FMQGPRNKAZYNRTWAJA",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Quality!",
        "reviewDescription": "I’m really happy with this scarf. The fabric is incredibly soft, warm, and lightweight at the same time. It drapes beautifully and looks much more expensive than it is. I’ve washed it twice already and it kept its shape and softness. Perfect for winter or chilly evenings. Highly recommend if you want something stylish and cozy.",
