        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFKLWTLACUOITMY5PVPLB7YKTYDQ",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Good looking, very soft, good size",
        "reviewDescription": "I got several colors of this scarf for travel.  They are small enough to pack in carryon or wear around my neck, and large enough for a bit of extra warmth on a plane.  They are soft and good looking but cheap enough that if something really awful got on them, I would not feel bad throwing them out.",
