        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Love This Pashmina",
        "reviewDescription": "I bought this to go with a skirt I love, which is an odd shade of blue that's hard to match. I fold it to use as a long scarf and it's perfect in shape and color. It also goes well with denim. The pattern is elegant and the weight is not too heavy or too light. I've already worn this with 2 outfits this week! I was a bit surprised that the pattern was only on one side of the fabric, but that doesn't matter for my needs. Great purchase!",
