    "aPlusContent": {
      "title": "Product description",
      "rawText": "Product description\nPrevious page\nNext page\n1 Starry Night - Van Gogh 2 Irises - Van Gogh 3 Bridge - Van Gogh 4 Isles of Shoals - Childe 5 Antibes - Monets \nWHY POETICEHOME CASHMERE SCARF SHAWL? \nWe meticulously choose the top-quality undercoat from cashmere goats and utilize the water-soluble technique to ensure optimal performance. Compared to common cashmere or wool, it is softer, lighter, warmer, and more breathable. \nFurthermore, it induces less itching than wool and is more durable. \nEMBRACE ULTIMATE SOFTNESS AND COMFORT ANYTIME \nCashmere retains air within its fibers, facilitating effective heat preservation and keeping the body snugly wrapped. \nIndoors, it can protect you from the AC draft in your cold office building, and outdoors, it provides warmth, comfort and elegance. \nTHOUGHTFULLY PREPARED GIFT WRAPPINGS \nINDULGE IN ARTISTIC OIL PAINTINGS AND SUPERB DYEING SKILLS \nWhat makes this 36\" x 36\" Cashmere Scarf different?​​ \nUltra-fine 200-count cashmere​ for unmatched softness and breathability, ​twill weave​ that boosts color vibrancy and durability, ​wrinkle-resistant​ and ​oversized 36\"x36\"​​ for versatile styling—luxury meets practicality. \nWhat are the differences between cashmere and wool and which is better for me? \nCashmere is soft and smooth on the skin, feeling like a gentle caress. It's lightweight and provides excellent warmth without being bulky. Wool isn't as soft as cashmere. If you want ultimate comfort and a luxurious touch, cashmere is best choice. \nCan this scarf be worn in all seasons? \nAbsolutely! The lightweight and breathable nature of cashmere makes it suitable for various seasons. It provides warmth in cooler weather and can be a stylish accessory in warmer months as well. It's great for blocking the AC breeze in a cold office. \nHow do I care for this 100% cashmere scarf shawl? \nIt is recommended to dry clean the scarf to maintain its quality. Avoid machine washing or using harsh detergents. \nHow is it packaged? Is it suitable for giving as a gift directly? \nEach scarf is packaged in an elegant and exquisite gift box. Absolutely suitable for presenting as a gift directly! The packaging adds to its charm and makes it a delightful surprise for the recipient.",
