          "type": "premium-module-2-fullbackground-image",
          "title": "INDULGE IN ARTISTIC OIL PAINTINGS AND SUPERB DYEING SKILLS",
          "subtitle": null,
          "text": null,
          "image": {
            "name": "PoeticEHome Shawl Wrap Scarf Large Square Pashmina for Women",
            "url": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/88861f23-709e-46ef-a060-f30ebdcd4669.__CR0,9,1464,600_PT0_SX1464_V1___.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "premium-module-11-faq",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "What makes this 36\" x 36\" Cashmere Scarf different?​​",
              "text": "Ultra-fine 200-count cashmere​ for unmatched softness and breathability, ​twill weave​ that boosts color vibrancy and durability, ​wrinkle-resistant​ and ​oversized 36\"x36\"​​ for versatile styling—luxury meets practicality."
            },
            {
              "name": "What are the differences between cashmere and wool and which is better for me?",
              "text": "Cashmere is soft and smooth on the skin, feeling like a gentle caress. It's lightweight and provides excellent warmth without being bulky. Wool isn't as soft as cashmere. If you want ultimate comfort and a luxurious touch, cashmere is best choice."
            },
            {
              "name": "Can this scarf be worn in all seasons?",
              "text": "Absolutely! The lightweight and breathable nature of cashmere makes it suitable for various seasons. It provides warmth in cooler weather and can be a stylish accessory in warmer months as well. It's great for blocking the AC breeze in a cold office."
            },
            {
              "name": "How do I care for this 100% cashmere scarf shawl?",
              "text": "It is recommended to dry clean the scarf to maintain its quality. Avoid machine washing or using harsh detergents."
            },
            {
              "name": "How is it packaged? Is it suitable for giving as a gift directly?",
              "text": "Each scarf is packaged in an elegant and exquisite gift box. Absolutely suitable for presenting as a gift directly! The packaging adds to its charm and makes it a delightful surprise for the recipient."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
