        "ratingScore": 4,
        "reviewTitle": "beautiful and delicate",
        "reviewDescription": "Beautiful, very soft, looks just as pictured, and packaged nicely, it's just very delicate; my long nails poked holes in it, but a quick rub of the fabric and the threads mended back together. So as long as you take care, its good",
