        "ratingScore": 3,
        "reviewTitle": "RECEIVED DEFECTIVE: 8\" RUN + SNAG",
        "reviewDescription": "5 Stars for excellent stitching of the edges of the scarf; 1 Star for a HUGE RUN (not a snag, right?) of about 8\" long, and a snag that perhaps started it. I WAS VERY DISAPPOINTED when I saw the problem as I was opening the box it came in. Ergo, I don't want to keep this ALREADY DEFECTIVE scarf. There also was a smell of a somewhat perfume in the scarf. MAYBE A RETURN BY A PRIOR CUSTOMER.",
