    "aPlusContent": {
      "title": "Product description",
      "rawText": "Product description\nBbalizko Mens Pirate Shirt Vampire Renaissance Victorian Halloween Costume \nBbalizko is an international online fashion store for men, boys and babies. We strive to provide high standard shirts, jumpsuits, overalls , sweaters and etc. \nMODEL SHOW \nThe video showcases the product in use.The video guides you through product setup.The video compares multiple products.The video shows the product being unpacked.\nBuyer's Show \nBuyer's show for your reference \nFEATURES:\nLong Sleeve\nLace Cuff\nRuffled Front/Solid Color\nBuyer’s comments \nGood quality for the price\nThis shir is beautiful. I will buy it again. I am using the shirt for a Halloween costume.\nA lovely fit, lovely feel, and sexy look\nSize Chart \nWarm Tips: \nPlease check BBALIZKO SIZE GUIDE before ordering, rather than the \"size chart\" beside the drop down box. If you don't want to slim fit, please choose the one step bigger size than your ordinary size.\nPlease allow 1-2cm differs due to manual measurement, thanks.\nIf you are satisfied with our clothes, please spend some time to give us a feedback and review.\nIf you have any questions, please send us messages or write your questions in Customer Questions & Answers, we will reply to you as soon as possible.",
