    "aPlusContent": {
      "title": "Product description",
      "rawText": "Product description\nVERSATILE \nFashion classy silk square scarves can be used as hair scarf, shawls, beanie, pirate, handbag accessory, hat decoration, cowboy neckerchief, headband, wrist wrap, waist band, decorations, hair accessories, etc. Suitable for business, commuting, party, travel, leisure, holiday, gifts. \nSingle Color, Simple Love. \n\"Now offering a wider range of single color options, there's always a suitable choice for your everyday outfit.\" \n\t\n21\" Square Scarf \n26\" Square Scarf \n26 inch Solid \n35 inch Solid \n68\"x21\" Long Scarf Wrap \n36\" Cashmere Scarf Wrap \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nBuying Options \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nAdd to Cart \n\t\nCustomer Reviews \n4.6 out of 5 stars 2,801 \n\t\n4.6 out of 5 stars 1,570 \n\t\n4.5 out of 5 stars 430 \n\t\n4.5 out of 5 stars 24 \n\t\n4.5 out of 5 stars 758 \n\t\n4.5 out of 5 stars 66 \n\t\nPrice $14.99$14.99 \t$19.99$19.99 \t$19.99$19.99 \t— no data \t$29.99$29.99 \t$49.99$49.99 \t\nFabrics: 100% Mulberry Silk \t100% Mulberry Silk \t100% Mulberry Silk \t100% Mulberry Silk \t100% Mulberry Silk \t100% Cashmere \t\nSize: 21\"x21\" | Small \t26\" x 26\" | Medium \t26\" x 26\" | Medium \t35\" x 35\" | Large \t68\"x21\" | Long \t36\" x 36\" (90x90cm) \t\n\nSelected Spring Silk Strictly \nThe silk spit out by silkworm babies in spring is tougher, shinier, and smoother. \nMulberry silk is protein fibres, warm in winter and cool in summer, protect you from sunlight and dust. \nMaterial: 100% Mulberry Silk \nSize: 26\" x 26\" \nSuitable size and various ingenious designed make it easy for you to match daily outfits. \nElaborately printed patterns make you delicate, chic, and gorgeous on any occasions. \nWashing and Maintenance Tips: \nDry cleaning recommended (√) \nHand wash, please wash with water below 30℃ (√) \nMachine wash prohibited (×) \nLow temperature ironing \nDo not wring out \nSpread out and dry",
