            "name": "PoeticEHome Silk Scarves",
            "url": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/f62ebfa3-7bf3-45db-a4a6-c2880ae5f08b.__CR0,0,1940,1200_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "3p-module-b",
          "title": null,
          "text": null,
          "image": {
            "name": "gift packaging",
            "url": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/9a9c5b9a-9ef3-4fc8-b7ed-7e3be2dc8a31.__CR0,0,1940,1200_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "3p-module-b",
          "title": "VERSATILE",
          "text": "Fashion classy silk square scarves can be used as hair scarf, shawls, beanie, pirate, handbag accessory, hat decoration, cowboy neckerchief, headband, wrist wrap, waist band, decorations, hair accessories, etc. Suitable for business, commuting, party, travel, leisure, holiday, gifts.",
          "image": {
            "name": "poeticehome mulberry silk scarves gift packed",
            "url": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/22dee5a6-f0b1-4a2d-8e15-6a71d4e4d0e2.__CR0,0,1940,1200_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "3p-module-b",
          "title": "Single Color, Simple Love.",
          "text": "\"Now offering a wider range of single color options, there's always a suitable choice for your everyday outfit.\"",
          "image": {
            "name": "Solid color silk scarf 01",
            "url": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/a4c8a79b-3c25-4906-a400-aa86ce9cd2e4.__CR0,0,1455,900_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "module-1",
          "title": "Material: 100% Mulberry Silk",
          "subtitle": "Size: 26\" x 26\"",
          "image": {
            "name": "silk scarf",
            "url": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/abe82f0a-fcc9-4884-a23e-8794757ac169.__CR245,0,1092,1455_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg"
          },
          "centerColumn": {
            "text": "Suitable size and various ingenious designed make it easy for you to match daily outfits. \nElaborately printed patterns make you delicate, chic, and gorgeous on any occasions. \nWashing and Maintenance Tips:",
            "textBox": "Dry cleaning recommended (√) \nHand wash, please wash with water below 30℃ (√) \nMachine wash prohibited (×) \nLow temperature ironing \nDo not wring out \nSpread out and dry"
          },
          "rightColumn": {
            "title": "Selected Spring Silk Strictly",
            "text": "The silk spit out by silkworm babies in spring is tougher, shinier, and smoother. \nMulberry silk is protein fibres, warm in winter and cool in summer, protect you from sunlight and dust.",
            "textBox": null,
            "image": {
              "name": "Mulberry silk",
              "url": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/ddcaa089-04dd-4022-8ee3-b9137ea2fbeb.__CR0,15,1550,775_PT0_SX350_V1___.png"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
