      {
        "username": "Gabriela Garcia",
        "userId": null,
        "userProfileLink": null,
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Luxurious but also incredibly versatile!",
        "reviewDescription": "I recently purchased the PoeticEHome 100% Pure Mulberry Silk Neck Scarf. This scarf, measuring 26\"x26\", is not only luxurious but also incredibly versatile. The quality of the silk is evident the moment you touch it—it's soft, smooth, and has a beautiful sheen that catches the light perfectly.What really impressed me were the gorgeous colors. Each shade is vibrant and well-saturated, making this scarf a standout accessory that can elevate any outfit. Whether I wear it around my neck, as a headband, or even tied to my handbag, it adds an instant touch of elegance.Additionally, the scarf came beautifully gift-packed, which makes it an excellent option for gifting. It’s truly a delightful addition to my wardrobe!",
        "date": "2025-12-27",
