      "Size and Washing: This unisex gym bag is 15.7 x 11.8 inches or 19.6 x 13.7 inches. The swim bag is big enough to carry a pair of shoes, bottle, basketball, an umbrella, a few books or clothing. Wash by hand or wipe with a cloth",
      "Drawstring Design: The drawstring closure of the travel backpack makes you store things quickly and take them in and out easily. Thick drawstrings avoids from digging into your shoulders and help reduce your shoulder burden",
      "Occasions: This travel backpack is great for everyday, work, gym, dance, travel, hiking, training, and more! Our special and stylish design makes it suitable for every occasion, providing a practical gift for your friends and family"
