  "description": "Traditional Waist Belt Russian Caucasus Costume Crystal Belt for Stage Elegant Wedding Bride Waist ChainFeatures:Elevating your wedding dress with this vintage inspired belt, featuring exquisited crystals that add a touch of luxury and elegances to any bridal lookings.The belt combines a gold chain with shimmering crystals, offering easy adjustability to suited various body types comfortably.Great for bride seeking a unique styles or anyone like to stand out special occasion.Perfectly complements wedding dresses, evening gowns, or party outfit, enhancing the overall elegances of your appearance.This crystal embellished body chain is a great accessory for those who appreciate timelessly fashion and like to make a statement.Specifications:Component: MetalProduct Dimension: Approx. length 110cm/43.31inchColor Option: Gold/SilverPackage Includes:1PC Caucasus BeltNote:Please allow 1-2cm error due to manual measurement.Due to the differences between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item.",
