  "brand": {
    "slogan": "HatynkaUA"
  },
  "description": "Every connoisseur of a Russian bath should have Sauna Hat for Men. Allows more time to enjoy in the hot sauna. Whether you go to sauna for a couple minutes or multiple sessions you need the reliability of our sauna cap for hair. The sauna head cover material is a big factor in Russian bath house hat – A major benefit of our steam hat is 100% organic wool material.  Easy design. Our Russian spa hat is a joy to wear. The soft, fluffy, light material allows you to wear it without noticing that you have something on your head whilst it reduces the risk of getting your head overheat or overcool and lets you to last in sauna longer.  One size fits all. After years of experience with customers we developed a Unisex size which should fit most of the adult heads. You can buy sauna hat for men and use as sauna hat for women. In both cases you will look perfect and protected.  Comfort and practicality. Our best sauna hat Reliably retains its shape, does not change color and volume after washing, dries quickly. It also provides convenience and ease of use of these Russian accessories.  Order Now and get this stylish Sauna Hat delivered to you!",
