        "reviewTitle": "OK",
        "reviewDescription": "As mentioned in other reviews, the top runs on the smaller side. I ordered 9-12 size for an 7.5 yo and it fit fine. The appearance is good and nothing falls off, but it is made of nonstreachable material and is very difficult to put on and off.  Still it serves the purpose of a one-time costume. However, if I had a babushka available to help, I would definitely ask her to sew something instead. You can buy better material for the high price of this costume.",
