        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Neat design for a horse lover, and nice to  have triangle shape without typical bulk",
        "reviewDescription": "I really like this idea of having a 'half' scarf instead of a big square one that becomes bulky when folded into a triangle.  I know I'm going to enjoy wearing this.  Just one quick note, though.  The color is a brownish with a very slight deep purple-ish undertone, and the background is ivory, not white.  I'll wear mine with my brown houndstooth jacket that it matches really well.",
        "date": "2026-01-14",
        "position": 1,
