        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFAWH77FKE3OQWHZ4VCG2IOS44DA",
        "ratingScore": 4,
        "reviewTitle": "Pretty but is a rust-red color",
        "reviewDescription": "Purchased K11-Red and White Small Patterns; very pretty but the ‘red’ is more rust-color to my eyes, therefore, didn’t work for what I was attempting to match it with. Unfortunately, returning. The color seems to be a bit more on the rust-red than blue-red.",
        "date": "2025-12-23",
        "position": 2,
