        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AH2NUR2IAK2Q6OOCZUKT7CSDQVHQ",
        "ratingScore": 2,
        "reviewTitle": "Don't really like this shawl",
        "reviewDescription": "Kinda disappointed with this shawl. Thought it was a white  background, but it's more off white. Like the striped pattern,  but is thinner than expected. Hoped I would, but I don't really like the shawl.",
        "date": "2026-02-08",
