      {
        "username": "Wiliama Loke",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AHDGZ7RS32SZX7SCHCCU25OBBRYQ",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHDGZ7RS32SZX7SCHCCU25OBBRYQ",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Beautiful, classic scarf to add as an investment piece to your wardrobe.",
        "reviewDescription": "I wear this as a scarf under the collar of my good black suit and it is beautiful there. It fits perfectly under the jacket collar and drapes down both front and back and really adds visual interest to the suit. The scarf is big at 56.3\" from end to end and 28\" from the front to the point in back and it has a lovely drape. (I got the \"Black bottomed underwater plants\" scarf.) The scarf is excellent quality satin with the pattern beautifully printed on it and actually looks like a much more expensive scarf. It is satin and has a lovely drape to the material which is very silky in feel. The value for the price and quality is excellent and I am giving different patterns of this scarf as a gift to several dear friends for their birthdays this year. Definitely a classic piece for your investment dressing wardrobe!",
        "date": "2026-01-21",
        "position": 6,
        "reviewedIn": "Reviewed in the United States on January 21, 2026",
        "reviewId": "R31P23F6TB6OUD",
        "reviewUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/customer-reviews/R31P23F6TB6OUD/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?ie=UTF8",
        "reviewImages": [],
        "reviewReaction": null,
        "isVerified": false,
        "isAmazonVine": false,
        "avatar": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/b72075cf-21ac-49e6-a65c-31e3cb75afe1._CR0%2C0%2C346%2C346_UX460_.jpg",
        "variant": "Color: K33-black-bottomed Underwater Plants（56.3×27.95inch）",
        "variantAttributes": [
          {
            "key": "Color",
            "value": "K33-black-bottomed Underwater Plants（56.3×27.95inch）"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "username": "Cobblepotts",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AEW2IHJZOMUI7GV6ESSYJYHD4XCQ",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEW2IHJZOMUI7GV6ESSYJYHD4XCQ",
        "ratingScore": 4,
        "reviewTitle": "Beautiful scarf",
        "reviewDescription": "This scarf is beautiful.  It is a triangular shape (56\"x28\") which can be styled in many different ways.  The tag on the scarf does not state that ii is silk or polyester. It only states the it is \"100% silk handle\" which means it is smooth, luxurious feeling and has a nice drape, which it does.  This is not a silk scarf but a polyester scarf, but it looks and feels like silk.  It must be hand washed.  The price is reasonable when I compared it to others similar to it.**My rating system: 5 stars means it exceeded my expectations, 4 stars met my expectations, 3 stars falls short of my expectations, 2 stars is considerably below my expectations and 1 star not recommending product",
        "date": "2025-12-05",
        "position": 7,
        "reviewedIn": "Reviewed in the United States on December 5, 2025",
        "reviewId": "R1J8OPEJ904AKG",
        "reviewUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/customer-reviews/R1J8OPEJ904AKG/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?ie=UTF8",
        "reviewImages": [],
        "reviewReaction": null,
        "isVerified": false,
        "isAmazonVine": false,
        "avatar": null,
        "variant": "Color: K14-red Fragmented Star River（56.3×27.95inch）",
        "variantAttributes": [
          {
            "key": "Color",
            "value": "K14-red Fragmented Star River（56.3×27.95inch）"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "username": "Rose",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AFPYW626R4YQHPD56TYVBN7W5SVQ",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFPYW626R4YQHPD56TYVBN7W5SVQ",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "This Scarf is My New Favorite Accessory (And Sometimes a Hair Emergency Fix)",
        "reviewDescription": "I have a drawer full of scarves that are either too thick, too short, or too fussy. When I unfolded this one, my first thought was, \"Oh, this is different.\" The long, slender triangle shape was not what I was used to, and the silky feeling fabric felt luxurious without being delicate.This scarf has become my go-to for adding a quick pop of color to an outfit. I've worn it tied loosely around my neck, and it's so lightweight it doesn't add any bulk. I've also used it as a head wrap on a bad hair day, and it held everything in place without feeling tight. The length is perfect for creating a nice, drapey look. I'm really hoping the fabric and the stitching on the edges hold up to being tied and untied repeatedly, as it's getting a lot of use.Here's my personal take:What won me over:· The fabric is fantastic. It has a beautiful, smooth drape and feels lovely against the skin.· The long, triangular cut is so versatile. It's easier to style in different ways than a standard square scarf.· It's incredibly lightweight, making it perfect for spring or an overly air-conditioned room.A couple of things to know:· The \"silk feeling\" is accurate—it's not actual silk. It's a very nice synthetic blend.· The print on mine was slightly less vibrant in person than in the product photo, but still very pretty.· Because it's so light, a strong wind might turn it into a personal flag.This scarf is a simple, elegant solution for when you want to look a little more put together with minimal effort. It's the kind of accessory that makes you feel polished without trying too hard. A wonderful, versatile piece to have in your collection.",
        "date": "2025-11-18",
        "position": 8,
        "reviewedIn": "Reviewed in the United States on November 18, 2025",
        "reviewId": "R1GAZHJPZN0NXD",
        "reviewUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/customer-reviews/R1GAZHJPZN0NXD/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?ie=UTF8",
        "reviewImages": [],
        "reviewReaction": null,
        "isVerified": false,
