      "title": "Product description",
      "rawText": "Product description\nThe video showcases the product in use.The video guides you through product setup.The video compares multiple products.The video shows the product being unpacked.\npaisley pashmina scarf shawl\nMerchant Video\nThe video showcases the product in use.The video guides you through product setup.The video compares multiple products.The video shows the product being unpacked.\npaisley pashmina shawl scarf\nMerchant Video\nTwo Tone Paisley Pashmina Shawl Scarf \nReddit Recommended Great Products \n\nFashion and Classic \nPAISLEY PASHMINA SHAWL SCARF \nFull Jacquard Craft\nAs shawl, scarf, hijab, turban headscarf etc.\nSuitable for travel,evening party,wedding, dinner, birthday, daily life etc.\nLovely gifts for your lover, family, friend in an anniversary, birthday etc.\nMore Product Choice \n\t\nNarrow Silk Scarf \nAdd to Cart \nPashmina Shawl Scarf \nAdd to Cart \nWool Shawl Scarf \nAdd to Cart \nMen Women Plaid Sscarf \nBuying Options \nSparkling Pashmina Shawl \nBuying Options \nSparkling Metallic Shawls \nAdd to Cart \nSpring Fall Silk Scarf \nAdd to Cart \nCustomer Reviews \n\t\n4.7 out of 5 stars 592 \n\t\n4.7 out of 5 stars 3,271 \n\t\n4.7 out of 5 stars 526 \n\t\n4.4 out of 5 stars 498 \n\t\n4.5 out of 5 stars 807 \n\t\n4.3 out of 5 stars 4,041 \n\t\n4.6 out of 5 stars 376 \n\t\nPrice \n\tGBP 5.08GBP5.08 \tGBP 9.37GBP9.37 \tGBP 9.62GBP9.62 \tGBP 5.55GBP5.55 \tGBP 9.38GBP9.38 \tGBP 8.89GBP8.89 \tGBP 8.14GBP8.14 \t\nFabric \n\tSilk Feeling \tHigh Quality Fabric \tWool+ Polyester \t50% Viscose + 50% Acrylic \tViscose + Glittering Metallic \t-- \tSilk Feeling Polyester Fabric \t\nSize \n\t59'' x 5.5''(150cm x 14cm) \t27 x 78 inches (70 x 200cm) \t27 x 78 inches (70 x 200cm) \t75'' x 13'' (190cm x 33cm) \t70.8\" x 27.5\" (180 x 70cm) \t19.5 x 70.6 inches \t70.8” X 33.5” (180cm X 85cm) \t\nSeason \n\tAll Seasons \tAll Seasons \tWinter Spring Fall \tWinter Spring Fall \tAll Seasons \tAll Seasons \tSpring Fall \t\nMultiple Color \n\t