        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Beautiful and Elegant Shawl!",
        "reviewDescription": "I bought this scarf for my wife to wear to a wedding, and it looked absolutely stunning on her! The soft pink color and subtle paisley pattern gave her outfit a classy and elegant touch. The fabric feels smooth and high-quality, and it drapes beautifully over the shoulders. It kept her warm without feeling heavy, which was perfect for an evening event. She received several compliments throughout the night. Highly recommend this if you’re looking for something stylish and comfortable for a special occasion!",
