      {
        "username": "Elaine & Tom",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AG73HFKDWAHAWU4E2OS6D47AZ5FQ",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AG73HFKDWAHAWU4E2OS6D47AZ5FQ",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "A thoughtful gift",
        "reviewDescription": "The first thing that caught my attention when I opened this shawl wrap was its incredibly soft texture. The fabric is a blend of polyester and pashmina, providing a cozy and comforting feel against my skin. The wrap is triangular in shape, fitting snugly around my shoulders and gracefully cascading down into two elegant points at the front. A clever knit-in loop on the right side allows me to secure the other front point, ensuring a secure and hassle-free closure. This thoughtful detail adds a touch of convenience to the wrap. The design is simple yet elegant, complementing any outfit without overpowering it. It’s an ideal wrap for chilly theater or restaurant evenings, or unexpected weather changes. Its wrinkle-resistant properties ensure that it retains its shape even after repeated use. Upon removing it from its original packaging, I was pleasantly surprised to find it wrinkle-free. I’ve decided to roll it up and carry it with me for those moments when I need a quick burst of warmth.",
        "date": "2025-12-21",
        "position": 5,
        "reviewedIn": "Reviewed in the United States on December 21, 2025",
        "reviewId": "R1393WNE0JDTL2",
        "reviewUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/customer-reviews/R1393WNE0JDTL2/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?ie=UTF8",
