      {
        "username": "Nichole S.",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AEWWSAE57GBJHKMQWSRS4GVPCY6Q",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEWWSAE57GBJHKMQWSRS4GVPCY6Q",
        "ratingScore": 4,
        "reviewTitle": "Great Buy if You Love Versatility",
        "reviewDescription": "This scarf is so versatile and stylish! The print is really pretty, and the length is just right-not too short, not too long-making it perfect for multiple uses. I’ve tried it on my handbag, in my hair and even as a neck scarf, and it worked beautifully. The fabric does have a bit of slip, so you’ll want to double-knot it if you’re tying it to your bag or wearing it in your hair. It took me a few tries of wrapping my purse handle to get it almost the way I wanted it to look. That is the reason for the 1 star deduction.Overall, it’s a lightweight, elegant accessory that instantly elevates the look of whatever you tie it on.",
