  "name": "Women's Gothic Leather Edwardian Victorian Flare Coat",
  "offers": {
    "price": 259.99,
    "priceCurrency": "$"
  },
  "brand": {
    "slogan": "Infinity Leather"
  },
  "description": "Indulge in the allure of gothic elegance with our Women's Gothic Leather Coat, a statement piece that seamlessly blends Edwardian and Victorian styles with a hint of gothic punk. Elegant Gothic Style: This leather coat combines a tailored trench design with a distinctive gothic flair, creating a unique and stylish look for the bold and fashion-forward. Premium Leather: Crafted from high-quality leather, this trench coat boasts both style and durability, ensuring it will be a long-lasting addition to your wardrobe. Double-Breasted Closure: The double-breasted button closure brings a classic and timeless element to this coat, enhancing its overall aesthetic with a touch of vintage charm. Tail Coat Hem: The dramatic tail coat hem adds a feminine touch to the jacket, giving it a distinctive and eye-catching silhouette reminiscent of Edwardian and Victorian fashion. Material: Constructed from 100% leather, this coat exudes a luxurious feel and quality construction, providing both style and substance to those who appreciate a unique fashion statement. The Women's Gothic Leather Coat is the ideal choice for those seeking to make a bold and stylish impression, combining elements of different eras with a contemporary gothic punk edge.",
