      {
        "username": "Erica Collins",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AHRJLET5EKBI6EQ43DEYWSQNMLVA",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHRJLET5EKBI6EQ43DEYWSQNMLVA",
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "“Bought This Coat for Valentine’s Day… Ended Up Feeling Like the Main Character in NYC”",
        "reviewDescription": "The media could not be loaded.\n                \n            \n                \n            \n            \n        \n    \n    \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    I did NOT expect this coat to change my entire energy — but it did.The moment I put it on, the fit hugged my waist perfectly, flattered my curves, and made me feel confident without trying too hard. The red leather is rich, bold, and luxurious — not cheap-looking at all. It looks way more expensive than it is.I wore it out on a cold Valentine’s Day evening and I’m not exaggerating when I say people actually stopped me to ask where I got it. Smiles. Compliments. Doors held open. A man literally crossed the street just to tell me I looked stunning.This coat doesn’t just keep you warm — it changes how you walk, how you smile, and how the world responds to you.If you’re debating it, stop.Buy the coat.Be seen.You deserve that energy.Sizing tip: True to size with room to move — if you want a snatched waist, this coat delivers.💋🔥❤️",
        "date": "2026-01-15",
        "position": 1,
        "reviewedIn": "Reviewed in the United States on January 15, 2026",
        "reviewId": "R23ZZ4IN9B8WPS",
        "reviewUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/customer-reviews/R23ZZ4IN9B8WPS/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?ie=UTF8",
