      {
        "username": "Tiger Mom",
        "userId": "amzn1.account.AGTQBFX7FRLNGJI55R23WYSF5KNQ",
        "userProfileLink": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGTQBFX7FRLNGJI55R23WYSF5KNQ",
        "ratingScore": 4,
        "reviewTitle": "Fits large",
        "reviewDescription": "The media could not be loaded.\n                \n            \n                \n            \n            \n        \n    \n    \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    I was expecting a more fitted coat. Cuz the whole point of the design is to accentuate the waist line. It is too big for me. But, have to give it a thumbs up for the quality of the leather and the workmanship. Thick material. I guess for cold days, you have to leave some room for a sweater. The design is unique. And the shipping is fast. It took less than a week to get here. Hope they can come out more colors and in size xxs.",
