        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Looks nice",
        "reviewDescription": "I bought the costume for school project and it would be great for that if wasn’t too small for my 7 year old (he is tall for his age) Should get 8-12 size instead. The top looks very nice. The quality is ok for the price. The only thing I didn’t like is Velcro, but since it doesn’t meant to be everyday clothing it is still ok.",
