        "ratingScore": 4,
        "reviewTitle": "It looks good but…",
        "reviewDescription": "It fits my 4 year old perfectly. I love the color and the quality is ok. I give 4 stars for the Velcro that is first of all itchy and second of all not very  Good choice for clothing especially when you do laundry. I would rather a nice native wooden buttons instead of the Velcro.",
