        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Looks good!",
        "reviewDescription": "It’s pretty nice, kind of thin. The embroidered areas are attached very well and straight. If the fabric were thicker it would be suuuper nice.",
        "date": "2024-01-15",
        "position": 5,
        "reviewedIn": "Reviewed in the United States on January 15, 2024",
