    "aPlusContent": {
      "title": "Product description",
      "rawText": "Product description\nMore than a shawl, it's a versatile companion that blends luxury with daily life. It invites you to explore new possibilities in your style and beyond. \nPrevious page\nNext page\n1 Dinner party 2 Wedding 3 Office 4 Plane 5 Hospital \nStyling is effortless: styled closed, loosely draped, or elegantly slung. From a cozy shawl to a sleek scarf, this versatile cashmere triangle is your ultimate travel ally. \nJourney in effortless comfort. Our travel-ready cashmere shawl combines a breathable feel with practical machine-washability and an easy-tie design for versatile styling. \nElegance meets warmth. For the weddings, parties, and special days, this cashmere shawl keeps you flawlessly styled and comfortably warm. Finish with your perfect color from our curated collection. \nWrap your love in lasting comfort. An exceptionally thoughtful gift for every occasion. Celebrate them with the timeless luxury of cashmere—a heartfelt token for those who matter most.",
