        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Cozy and stylish.",
        "reviewDescription": "I love this knitted shawl wrap! It adds just the right amount of warmth to any fall outfit without feeling bulky. The size is perfect — not too big, not too small — and it drapes beautifully.",
        "date": "2025-11-04",
