      {
        "username": "Canuck",
        "userId": null,
        "userProfileLink": null,
        "ratingScore": 4,
        "reviewTitle": "Shawl is soft and comfortable.  Tag kinds of stands out, not in a good way",
        "reviewDescription": "When I work in my downtown office, sometimes the temperature can fluctuate quite a bit. I usually dress expecting it to be warm, and add layers if necessary.This shawl is quite soft, and has a loop at one end to be able to secure it around your shoulders by tucking one end into the loop.These are one size fits all, so if you're a larger size person like I am, don't expect it tocover as much as it does the model on the product page.  I still find it attractive and keeps my shoulders covered and warm.The loop seems to hold it in place fairly well so I don't need to worry about it slipping off my shoulders.  If you find it comes loose easily, just put it through the loop more than once.Overall I'm pleased with this. I own a lot of black clothing, I kind of wish I'd ordered it in a different colour but this still looks great. The only downside, I’m not a fan of the brown pleather tag on my black shawl, I don’t really want a label front and centre. But otherwise I like it.",
        "date": "2025-11-04",
        "position": 2,
        "reviewedIn": "Reviewed in Canada on November 4, 2025",
        "reviewId": "R3VC2RQ8D91YIO",
        "reviewUrl": null,
