      {
        "username": "Canadian Shopper",
        "userId": null,
        "userProfileLink": null,
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Soft, Cozy, Versatile Piece",
        "reviewDescription": "This is a beautifully soft and elegant pashmina. It provides the right amount of coverage and warmth for a spring or fall night.It has a variety of ways to wear it and includes a loop for hands free security. The length is perfect for a drape or knotted wrap. The colour has held up after a wash. The fabric is medium weight and exactly what I was looking for. For the price (just under $27 at the time of this review) it is a very reasonable price for such a versatile and staple piece of your wardrobe :)",
