        "userProfileLink": null,
        "ratingScore": 5,
        "reviewTitle": "Perfectly warming",
        "reviewDescription": "We had a string of cold days at the start of November where this really came in handy. Its like just the right size and thickness to hold in heat without overheating. I'm not sure I like the closure type because it makes the whole thing feel a bit unbalanced, but the texture of the fabric is soft and it doesn't bother my sensitive skin. Would recommend.",
